Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.36,0:00:28.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}JS If 1 didn't care f
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.49,0:00:33.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}~ More than words can say J
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.83,0:00:38.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}JS If 1 didn't care f
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.00,0:00:44.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}ft Would I feel this way? f
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.42,0:00:49.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}J If this isn't love f
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.76,0:00:54.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}肖申克的救赎\N{\rEN\blur0.8}~ Then why do I thrill? I
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.06,0:01:01.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}~ And what makes my head Go round and round f
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.19,0:01:06.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}~ While my heart stands still? f
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.11,0:01:11.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}JS If 1 didn't care f
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.28,0:01:16.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}S Would it be the same? f
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.66,0:01:22.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}~ Would my every prayer Begin and end f
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.46,0:01:27.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}With just your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.21,0:01:32.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}~ And would I be sure That this is love f
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.01,0:01:37.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}J Beyond compare? Jf
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.93,0:01:41.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}S Would all this be true f
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.18,0:01:48.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}f If I didn't care for you? Lf
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.15,0:01:53.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}JS If 1 didn't care f
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.16,0:01:58.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}~ Honey child, more than words can say f
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.62,0:02:03.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}lf 1 didn't care... I
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.46,0:02:06.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}杜弗伦先生 请你描述\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mr. Dufresne, describe...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.63,0:02:11.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}命案当晚和妻子争吵的情形\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...the confrontation you had with your wife the night she was murdered.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.64,0:02:17.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们吵的很凶\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It was very bitter.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.64,0:02:22.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她说不怕我知道，她讨厌偷偷摸摸\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She said she was glad I knew, that she hated all the sneaking around.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.52,0:02:27.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她还说 想去雷诺市办离婚\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And she said that she wanted a divorce in Reno.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.19,0:02:30.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-你怎样回答？  -我拒绝离婚\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-What was your response?   -I told her I would not grant one.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.07,0:02:34.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你别想活着去雷诺市\N{\rEN\blur0.8}"I'll see you in hell before I see you in Reno."
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.45,0:02:37.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}邻居作证你说过这句话\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Those were your words, according to your neighbors.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.91,0:02:40.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}也许吧\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If they say so.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.04,0:02:43.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我气炸了 记不清楚\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I really don't remember. I was upset.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.83,0:02:46.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们吵完以后呢？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What happened after you argued with your wife?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.42,0:02:49.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她收拾行李\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She packed a bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.38,0:02:53.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}去跟昆丁先生住一起\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She packed a bag to go and stay with Mr. Quentin.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.17,0:02:58.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}葛兰 昆丁 乡村俱乐部高尔夫球教练\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Glenn Quentin, golf pro at the Snowden Hills Country Club...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.43,0:03:01.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你最近才发现，他是你太太的情夫\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...whom you had discovered was your wife's lover.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.93,0:03:05.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你跟踪她吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Did you follow her?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.44,0:03:08.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我先是去酒吧买醉\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I went to a few bars first.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.73,0:03:13.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}然后开车去他家对质，但没人在\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Later, I drove to his house to confront them. They weren't home.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.74,0:03:15.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我停了车\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I parked in the turnout...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.95,0:03:16.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}等他们\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...and waited.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.07,0:03:18.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}用意何在？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}With what intention?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.41,0:03:20.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不确定\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm not sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.95,0:03:23.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我糊里糊涂的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I was confused...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.70,0:03:24.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}喝醉了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...drunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.29,0:03:27.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我想心\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I think...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.67,0:03:29.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我主要是想吓吓他们\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...mostly I wanted to scare them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.04,0:03:33.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}结果他们一回来 你就冲进屋杀了他们\N{\rEN\blur0.8}When they arrived, you went up to the house and murdered them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.59,0:03:35.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不 我逐渐酒醒\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, I was sobering up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.92,0:03:39.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}回到车上 开回家睡觉去了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I got back in the car and I drove home to sleep it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.76,0:03:42.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}回家路上我把枪丢进了皇家河\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Along the way, I threw my gun into the Royal River.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.97,0:03:45.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这一点我已经讲的很清楚了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I've been very clear on this point.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.22,0:03:49.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但清洁女工隔天早晨上工的时候\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I get hazy where the cleaning woman shows up the following morning...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.44,0:03:52.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}发现你的妻子和她的情人一起躺在床上\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...and finds your wife in bed with her lover...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.27,0:03:54.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}浑身都是.3 38口径的弹孔\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...riddled with.38-caliber bullets.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.78,0:04:00.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你不觉得这很巧吗， 还是只有我这么想？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Does that strike you as a fantastic coincidence, or is it just me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.87,0:04:01.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是的 很巧\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes, it does.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.03,0:04:05.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但你仍然声称自己早在案发之前\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yet you still maintain you threw your gun into the river...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.41,0:04:07.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就把枪丢进了河里\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...before the murders took place.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.66,0:04:10.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这个说法很省事\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's very convenient.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.17,0:04:11.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是实话\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.17,0:04:16.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}警方在河里打捞了三三天都没有找到枪\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The police dragged that river for three days, and nary a gun was found...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.92,0:04:21.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这样就无法比对你的枪\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...SO NO Comparison could be made between your gun and the bullets...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.22,0:04:24.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}和血迹斑斑的受害者身上取出的子弹\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...taken from the bloodstained corpses of the victims.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.35,0:04:27.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以说\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And that also...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.23,0:04:31.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这样真的很省事。 不是吗 杜弗伦先生？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}..IS very convenient. Isn't it, Mr. Dufresne?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.02,0:04:35.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是清白的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Since I am innocent of this crime...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.23,0:04:39.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以找不到枪反而很费事\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...1 find it decidedly inconvenient that the gun was never found.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.65,0:04:44.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}f With just your name f
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.58,0:04:51.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}~ And would I be sure That this is love f
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.42,0:04:56.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}J Beyond compare? Jf
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.80,0:05:01.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}女士们先生们，一切证据 都已经呈现在各位面前\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ladies and gentlemen, you've heard all the evidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.34,0:05:05.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}被告人当时身处案发现场。 我们已经收集到他的脚印\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We have the accused at the scene of the crime. We have footprints.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.35,0:05:08.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现场地面的子弹上沾有他的指纹\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Bullets on the ground bearing his fingerprints.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.43,0:05:11.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还有一个破碎的波本威士忌酒瓶， 上面同样沾有他的指纹\N{\rEN\blur0.8}A broken bourbon bottle, likewise with fingerprints.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.60,0:05:13.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}最重要的是\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And most of all...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.36,0:05:16.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们发现一位年轻美丽 的女子和她的情夫\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...we have a beautiful young woman and her lover...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.65,0:05:18.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}相拥而死\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...lying dead in each other's arms.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.90,0:05:22.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们的所为的确有伤风化\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They had sinned.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.74,0:05:26.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但是\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But was their crime so great...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.49,0:05:28.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们罪该致死吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...as to merit a death sentence?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.91,0:05:31.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}与此同时\N{\rEN\blur0.8}While you think about that...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.67,0:05:34.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}请各位再考虑一件事：\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...think about this:
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.34,0:05:39.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}左轮手枪的容弹量 是六发 不是八发\N{\rEN\blur0.8}A revolver holds six bullets, not eight.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.21,0:05:43.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以我推断，本案并非 一时冲动所导致的谋杀\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I submit that this was not a hot-blooded crime of passion.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.13,0:05:46.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}冲动仍然不可宽恕 但至少可以理解\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That at least could be understood, if not condoned.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.14,0:05:47.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.39,0:05:49.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是一次复仇\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This was revenge...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.52,0:05:53.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是一次极其残忍而 冷血的复仇。想想看：\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...of a much more brutal, cold-blooded nature. Consider this:
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.35,0:05:55.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}每名受害人身中四发子弹\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Four bullets per victim.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.52,0:05:58.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}凶手开了不止六枪 而是八枪\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Not six shots fired, but eight.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.78,0:06:02.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这就意味着，凶手先是 打空了枪中的所有子弹\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That means that he fired the gun empty...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.61,0:06:05.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}随后停下来重新装弹\N{\rEN\blur0.8}..and then stopped to reload...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.49,0:06:08.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}并再次向受害人射击\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...SO that he could shoot each of them again.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.41,0:06:11.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这对爱侣每人再挨一枪\N{\rEN\blur0.8}An extra bullet per lover...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.79,0:06:13.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}每枪都正中头部\N{\rEN\blur0.8}.. fight in the head.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.04,0:06:21.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}杜弗伦先生 你给我的印象是 面目冷漠，毫无悔意\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You strike me as a particularly icy and remorseless man, Mr. Dufresne.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.26,0:06:24.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}光是看着你，我的血液都在变冷\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It chills my blood just to look at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.30,0:06:29.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}根据缅因州赋予我的权力\N{\rEN\blur0.8}By the power vested in me by the state of Maine...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.26,0:06:33.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}本庭判决你连服两个无期徒刑\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...I hereby order you to serve two life sentences back-to-back...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.94,0:06:36.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}为两位死者偿命 退庭！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...one for each of your victims. So be it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.59,0:07:02.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}坐下\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sit.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.30,0:07:10.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你被判无期徒刑， 已经服刑20年 对吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We see you've served 20 years of a life sentence?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.06,0:07:14.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一是的 -你觉得自己已经改过自新了么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Yes, Sir.   -You feel you've been rehabilitated?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.68,0:07:17.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是的 这是一定的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, yes, sir. Absolutely, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.40,0:07:20.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是说 我已经得到了教训\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean, I learned my lesson.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.48,0:07:24.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真的 我现在已经洗心革面了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I can honestly say that I'm a changed man.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.16,0:07:30.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不会再危害社会\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm no longer a danger to society.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.66,0:07:32.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有上帝为证\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's God's honest truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.29,0:07:39.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}驳回
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.99,0:08:11.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿 瑞德\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, Red. How'd it go?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.45,0:08:11.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.95,0:08:14.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还不是老样子\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Same old shit, different day.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.41,0:08:16.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我懂你\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, I know how you feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.45,0:08:18.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我下周也准备被驳回了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm up for rejection next week.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.25,0:08:21.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊 我上周也被驳回了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, I got rejected last week.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.96,0:08:23.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没办法\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.46,0:08:25.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿 瑞德 来包烟呗\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, Red, bump me a deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.13,0:08:28.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}赶紧滚！ 你还欠着我5包呢\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Get out of my face, man! You're into me for five packs already.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.59,0:08:29.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-是4包！  -5包！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Four!   -Five!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.76,0:08:34.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}美国各大监狱都少不了我这种人\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There must be a con like me in every prison in America.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.39,0:08:36.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么我都弄得到\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm the guy who can get it for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.39,0:08:39.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我能搞到香烟 如果你喜欢 还有大麻\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Cigarettes, a bag of reefer, if that's your thing...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.69,0:08:43.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}孩子高中毕业你想庆祝一下 我还能帮你弄瓶白兰地\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...a bottle of brandy to celebrate your kid's high school graduation.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.36,0:08:45.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}只要是合情合理的要求 几乎什么我都弄得到\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Damn near anything within reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.65,0:08:49.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没错，我就是天天开张的 连锁百货商店\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes, sir. I'm a regular Sears and Roebuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.36,0:08:55.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以 安迪 杜弗伦1949年入狱的时候\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So when Andy Dufresne came to me in 1949...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.45,0:08:59.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}让我给他弄一张丽塔■海华丝的海报\N{\rEN\blur0.8}..and asked me to smuggle Rita Hayworth into the prison for him...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.25,0:09:01.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我只说：没问题\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...I told him, "No problem."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.10,0:09:25.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}全体警员到大门处集合 全体警员到大门处集合\N{\rEN\blur0.8}MAN: Officers to main gate. Officers to main gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.94,0:09:28.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}守卫大门\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Secure main gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.37,0:09:45.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}安迪来到肖申克监狱\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Andy came to Shawshank Prison...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.84,0:09:49.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还是在1947年年初 罪名是 谋杀自己的老婆和老婆的情夫\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...In early 1947 for murdering his wife and the fella she was banging.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.01,0:09:54.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在外面 他曾经是波特兰 一家大银行的副总裁\N{\rEN\blur0.8}On the outside, he'd been vice president of a large Portland bank.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.51,0:09:56.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}典型的青年才俊\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Good work for a man so young.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.68,0:10:03.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿 瑞德\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, Red.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.56,0:10:41.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}肥猪 懂英文么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You speak English, butt-steak?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.52,0:10:43.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}跟这位警官走\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You follow this officer.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.16,0:11:00.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我这辈子没看过这么窝囊的人渣\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I never seen such a sorry-looking heap of maggot shit in all my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.66,0:11:03.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿 新来的！ 过来！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, fish! Come over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.52,0:11:27.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}今天又玩打赌啊，瑞德？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Taking bets today, Red?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.27,0:11:30.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}赌烟还是赌钱？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Smokes or coin? Bettor's choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.19,0:11:31.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}烟 我赌两根\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Smokes. Put me down for two.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.44,0:11:34.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}行 你挑谁？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All right, who's your horse?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.19,0:11:36.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那个小窝囊废\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That little sack of shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.82,0:11:40.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-第八个 他是头名 -扯淡！ 本来我想挑他的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Eighth. Eighth from the front. He'll be first.   -Oh, bullshit! I'll take that action.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.78,0:11:43.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}小子 你可要输烟喽\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Yeah, me too.   -You're out some smokes, son.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.45,0:11:45.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你聪明 你挑啊\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If you're so smart, you call it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.46,0:11:48.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我挑肥肥大大的那个\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'll take the chubby fat-ass there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.67,0:11:51.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}第五个 我赌5根烟\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The fifth one. Put me down for a quarter deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.13,0:11:54.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Fresh Fish!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.50,0:11:56.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}菜鸟来啦！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Fresh fish today!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.97,0:11:58.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}菜鸟来啦！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We're reeling them in!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.14,0:12:02.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}说实话 当初我并不看好安迪\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I admit I didn't think much of Andy first time I laid eyes on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.31,0:12:06.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一副弱不禁风的样子\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Looked like a stiff breeze would blow him over.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.56,0:12:08.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是他给我的最初印象\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That was my first impression of the man.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.85,0:12:10.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你挑谁？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What do you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.48,0:12:13.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那个一脸富贵相的高个儿\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That tall drink of water with the silver spoon up his ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.98,0:12:16.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他？ 不可能\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That guy? Never happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.32,0:12:18.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-我赌10根 -真舍得下本啊\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Ten cigarettes. That's a rich bet.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.78,0:12:20.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谁来和我赌一把？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Who's going to prove me wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.07,0:12:22.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}赫伍？ 渣哥？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Heywood? Jigger?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.20,0:12:24.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}史基？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Skeets?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.66,0:12:26.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}福洛！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Floyd!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.00,0:12:29.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们四个输定了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Four brave souls.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.21,0:12:32.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}回牢房准备晚点名\N{\rEN\blur0.8}MAN: Return to your cellblocks for evening count.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.21,0:12:35.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}全部回房去\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All prisoners, return to your cellblocks.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.90,0:12:58.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}向右转！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Turn to the right! Eyes front.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.19,0:12:58.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看前方
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.62,0:13:14.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他是警备队长海利\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is Mr. Hadley. He's captain of the guards.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.42,0:13:16.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是典狱长诺顿\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm Mr. Norton, the warden.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.67,0:13:19.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们因为作奸犯科\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You are convicted felons.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.22,0:13:21.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以才进监狱受我管制\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's why they've sent you to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.80,0:13:23.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}第一条规定：\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rule number one:
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.34,0:13:24.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不可渎神\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No blasphemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.39,0:13:28.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不准滥呼上主之名\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'll not have the Lord's name taken in vain in my prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.02,0:13:30.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}至于其它规矩\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The other rules...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.44,0:13:33.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}慢慢学吧 有问题吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}... you'll figure out as you go along. Any questions?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.10,0:13:35.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么时候吃饭？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}When do we eat?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.86,0:13:45.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们叫你吃就吃\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You eat when we say you eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.28,0:13:49.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}叫你拉就拉 叫你撒就撒\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You shit when we say you shit, and piss when we Say you piss.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.54,0:13:52.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}懂吗 死人渣？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You got that, you maggot-dick motherfucker?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.25,0:13:55.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}站起来\N{\rEN\blur0.8}On your feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.79,0:13:57.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我相信两个东西\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I believe in two things:
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.80,0:14:00.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一为管训，二为圣经\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Discipline and the Bible.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.76,0:14:02.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在这儿 你们两样都少不了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Here, you'll receive both.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.59,0:14:05.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}把信仰托给神\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Put your trust in the Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.35,0:14:08.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}把贱命交给我\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Your ass belongs to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.43,0:14:12.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}欢迎来到肖申克监狱\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Welcome to Shawshank.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.52,0:14:18.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}解\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Unhook them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.28,0:14:25.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}转身\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Turn around.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.54,0:14:34.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}可以了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.87,0:14:36.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}走到头\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Move to the end of the cage.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.88,0:14:40.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}转身 撒除虱粉\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Turn around. Delouse him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.55,0:14:43.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}转身\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Turn around.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.64,0:14:49.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}出来 去领囚衣和圣经\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Move out of the cage. Pick up your clothes and Bible.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.51,0:14:50.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}下-个！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Next man up!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.18,0:14:55.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}向右 右转 右转\N{\rEN\blur0.8}To the right. Right. Right. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.48,0:14:57.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}向左\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Left. Left.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.11,0:15:01.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}头一夜最难熬。这是肯定的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The first night's the toughest. No doubt about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.32,0:15:05.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}像刚出生的孩子一样 赤条条排队行进\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They march you in naked as the day you were born...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.61,0:15:09.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}浑身撒上什么狗屁除虱粉 火辣辣的几乎要把人烫瞎\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...8kin burning and half-blind from that delousing shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.16,0:15:12.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}然后你就被关进牢笼\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And when they put you in that cell...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.70,0:15:15.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}当铁栅栏门沉重关上的时候\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...and those bars slam home...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.54,0:15:17.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你才知道 这回是动真格的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...that's when you know it's for real.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.38,0:15:21.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}眨眼之间 一辈子就毁了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Old life blown away in the blink of an eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.84,0:15:26.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一切都消失了 只剩下 囚笼里无尽的悔恨\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Nothing left but all the time in the world to think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.01,0:15:30.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}大多数新来的人， 头天晚上都快被逼疯\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Most new fish come close to madness the first night.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.76,0:15:33.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}总会有人扛不住哭出来\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Somebody always breaks down crying.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.18,0:15:35.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}每次都是这样\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Happens every time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.77,0:15:38.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们只是想知道\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The only question is...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.73,0:15:40.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这次先哭出来的是谁\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...wWho's it going to be?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.94,0:15:44.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}拿这个来打赌，应该 算是挺有意思的吧\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's as good a thing to bet on as any, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.94,0:15:48.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我赌杜弗伦第一个受不住\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I had my money on Andy Dufresne.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.62,0:15:59.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}熄灯！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Lights out!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.81,0:16:22.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我还记得我的第一夜\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I remember my first night.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.02,0:16:25.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}感觉已经是很久以前的事了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Seems like a long time ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.16,0:16:30.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}菜鸟\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, fish.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.74,0:16:34.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}菜鸟 菜鸟\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Fish, fish, fish, fish, fishy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.16,0:16:37.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}怎么，怕黑了么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What are you, scared of the dark?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.25,0:16:42.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是不是后悔爸妈搞出你来？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Bet you wish your daddy never dicked your mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.13,0:16:46.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}小猪猪！ 我想来块猪排\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Piggy! Pork! I want me a pork chop. Oh, yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.43,0:16:53.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-起屁股来 让爷瞧瞧！  -小声点\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Poke your ass out, give me a first look! Shh! Keep it down.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.89,0:16:57.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们老是捉弄新来的人\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The boys always go fishing with first-timers.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.52,0:17:00.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}直到把人逗哭才罢休\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And they don't quit till they reel someone in.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.85,0:17:03.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿 胖猪\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, Fat Ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.94,0:17:06.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}胖猪！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Fat Ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.44,0:17:09.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}说句话嘛\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Talk to me, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.20,0:17:12.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我知道你在 我能听到你喘气儿\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I Know you're there. I can hear you breathing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.74,0:17:15.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别被这些傻子骗了 听见没？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't you listen to these nitwits, you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.91,0:17:17.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这地方其实还不赖\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This place ain't so bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.29,0:17:19.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我跟你讲\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Tell you what...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.79,0:17:23.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我帮你到处介绍介绍，带你认识人\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...I'll introduce you around, make you feel right at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.46,0:17:27.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我认识几个五大三粗的同性恋\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I Know a couple of big old bull queers that'd just...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.71,0:17:29.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们绝对想跟你打打交道\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...love to make your acquaintance.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.80,0:17:33.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就因为你那圆润的大白屁股\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Especially that big, white, mushy butt of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.51,0:17:34.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天呐！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}God!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.30,0:17:36.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不要坐牢！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't belong here!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.89,0:17:39.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-赢家出现啦！  -我要回家！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We have a winner! I want to go home!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.02,0:17:42.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}肥猪率先冲过终点线！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And it's Fat Ass by a nose!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.48,0:17:49.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}菜鸟！ 菜鸟！ 菜鸟！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}MEN: Fresh fish! Fresh fish! Fresh fish!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.48,0:17:51.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不要坐牢\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't belong here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.32,0:17:55.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我要回家！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I want to go home!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.16,0:17:57.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我要妈妈！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I want my mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.66,0:17:59.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我搞过你妈妈，很一般嘛！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I had your mother! She wasn't that great!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.17,0:18:06.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天杀的 你们在搞什么！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What the Christ is this horseshit?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.34,0:18:08.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他在渎神 我要报告典狱长\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He blasphemed. I'll tell the warden.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.63,0:18:12.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-等我先把警棍插你屁眼里你再去告吧！  -放我出去！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-You'll tell him with my baton up your ass! You gotta let me out!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.30,0:18:15.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}狗崽子 你哪根筋不对？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What is your malfunction, you fat barrel of monkey spunk?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.89,0:18:19.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}求求你！ 我不想进监狱\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Please! I ain't supposed to be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.43,0:18:20.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别关我！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Not me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.64,0:18:23.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不想数到三 连一都不会数\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I won't count to three. Not even to one.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.18,0:18:25.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}再不闭嘴我就打死你！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You will shut up, or I'll sing you a lullaby!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.77,0:18:28.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一闭嘴 快闭嘴啊！ -判决有问题\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Shut up, man. Shut up! There's been a mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.23,0:18:31.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们不懂，我不该坐牢的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You don't understand. I'm not supposed to be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.07,0:18:33.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}打开牢门\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Open that cell.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.57,0:18:36.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我也不想坐牢！ 这鬼地方 和监狱有什么两样？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Me neither! They run this place like a fucking prison!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.71,0:18:46.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}狗娘养的！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Son of a bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.30,0:18:53.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}长官 别激动！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Captain, take it easy!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.03,0:19:19.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}今天晚上 谁再敢出一丁点儿声音\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If I hear so much as a mouse fart in here tonight...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.45,0:19:22.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我对天发誓，非得把你们全打进医务室\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...I swear by God and Jesus, you will all visit the infirmary.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.41,0:19:25.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-个都不放过\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Every last motherfucker in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.17,0:19:32.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}把受托人找来 把这坨废物抬到医务室\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Call the trustees. Take that tub of shit down to the infirmary.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.14,0:19:51.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是他在牢里的第一夜， 杜弗伦让我输了两包烟\N{\rEN\blur0.8}His first night in the joint, Dufresne cost me two packs of cigarettes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.98,0:19:55.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他一声都没皖\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He never made a sound.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.38,0:20:12.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}三层北 到齐！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Tier 3 north, clear count!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.88,0:20:15.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-二层北 到齐 -二层南 到齐\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Tier 2 north, clear. Tier 2 south, clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.96,0:20:19.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}三层南 到齐\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Tier 3 south, clear. Tier 1 north, clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.14,0:20:22.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-一层南，到齐 -四层南 到齐\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Tier 1 south, clear. Tier 4 south, clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.14,0:20:24.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}准备离房\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Prepare to roll out.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.31,0:20:29.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}出发！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Roll out!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.95,0:21:25.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你吃么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Are you going to eat that?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.54,0:21:28.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}完全没这个想法\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I hadn't planned on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.91,0:21:31.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}给我好么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Do you mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.71,0:21:41.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}又肥又嫩\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's nice and ripe.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.90,0:21:55.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}小杰说 谢谢你\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Jake says thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.44,0:21:58.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他从巢里掉到地上\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Fell out of his nest over by the plate shop.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.07,0:22:03.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我要养到他会飞\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm going to look after him until he's big enough to fly.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.91,0:22:06.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}讨厌！ 他来了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, no, no! Here he comes.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.70,0:22:11.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}大伙早啊\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Morning, fellas.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.37,0:22:13.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}多么美好的早晨\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Fine morning, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.62,0:22:15.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}知不知道为什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know why it's a fine morning, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.13,0:22:18.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}都掏出来 我得把它给摆好了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on, send them down. I want them all lined up...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.63,0:22:21.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}跟合唱团一样，一排一排站好队\N{\rEN\blur0.8}.. just like a pretty little chorus line.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.30,0:22:23.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看看\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, look at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.05,0:22:27.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-真受不了他 -我的乖乖\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I can't stand this guy. Oh, Lord!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.89,0:22:30.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没错！ 弗吉尼亚州里士满 出产的正宗好烟\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes! Richmond, Virginia.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.52,0:22:31.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}闻我的屁吧\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Smell my ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.06,0:22:34.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}先闻我的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}After he smells mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.02,0:22:38.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们都选错人了 真是可惜呀\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Gee, Red, that's a shame about your horse coming in last and all.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.40,0:22:41.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不过我可是爱死我选的那位了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But I sure do love that winning horse of mine, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.44,0:22:44.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}等我见到他 非得 好好亲亲他不可\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I believe I owe that boy a great big sloppy kiss when I see him.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.61,0:22:48.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你怎么不想着请他抽根烟呢？ 一副小人得志的样\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Why don't you give him some of your cigarettes instead? Lucky fuck!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.16,0:22:50.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}泰瑞\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, Tyrell.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.08,0:22:53.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这周医务室你当班？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You pull infirmary duty this week?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.00,0:22:55.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我的肥仔怎么样了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How's that horse of mine doing anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.00,0:22:57.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}死了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.96,0:23:00.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}海利把他打了个满头开花\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hadley busted his head up pretty good.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.34,0:23:02.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}医生已经回家睡觉了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Doc had gone home for the night.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.09,0:23:05.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这可怜家伙一直躺到天亮\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Poor bastard lay there till this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.51,0:23:08.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天亮以后 说什么都晚了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}By then, there wasn't nothing we could do.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.31,0:23:15.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他叫什么名字？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What was his name?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.98,0:23:20.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你说什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What'd you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.15,0:23:24.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我想知道他的名字\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I was just wondering if anyone knew his name.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.24,0:23:28.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}关你屁事啊，你个菜鸟！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What the fuck do you care, new fish?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.99,0:23:32.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有没有名字有关系么？ 死人一个了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Doesn't fucking matter what his name was. He's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.68,0:23:53.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.18,0:23:56.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有人上过你了吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Anybody come at you yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.35,0:24:00.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你名草有主了吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Anybody get to you yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.86,0:24:04.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿 在牢里 我们都需要朋友\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, we all need friends in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.69,0:24:06.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我可以当你朋友\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I could be a friend to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.66,0:24:11.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.54,0:24:17.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不好上手\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hard to get.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.04,0:24:20.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我喜欢\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.51,0:24:30.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}起初 安迪不怎么和人来往\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Andy kept pretty much to himself at first.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.05,0:24:33.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}大概心事不少吧\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I guess he had a lot on his mind...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.47,0:24:36.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}努力适应监狱生活\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...trying to adapt to life on the inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.06,0:24:40.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}直到一个月后\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Wasn't until a month went by that he finally opened his mouth...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.40,0:24:42.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他才开始找人攀谈\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...t0 say more than two words to somebody.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.02,0:24:45.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那个人\N{\rEN\blur0.8}As it turned out...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.07,0:24:47.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就是我\N{\rEN\blur0.8}... that somebody was me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.16,0:24:54.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}MAN: Officers Russell and Berwell, report to duty officer.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.95,0:24:56.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Russell and Berwell, report to....
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.70,0:24:58.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我叫安迪 杜弗伦\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm Andy Dufresne.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.71,0:25:01.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就是那个杀妻的银行家\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Wife-killing banker.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.67,0:25:05.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}为了什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Why'd you do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.42,0:25:07.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}实话说 下手的不是我\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I didn't, since you ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.09,0:25:10.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你算找对地方了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're going to fit right in.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.18,0:25:12.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这儿人人都很无辜，懂么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Everybody in here's innocent. Didn't you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.47,0:25:16.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-你是怎么进来的？  -我啥都没干 被律师搞惨了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-What you in here for?   -Didn't do it. Lawyer fucked me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.73,0:25:22.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听说你特别爱要酷\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rumor has it you're a real cold fish.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.44,0:25:26.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是不是觉得自己拉屎都比别人香？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You think your shit smells sweeter than most. Is that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.23,0:25:27.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你觉得呢？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.11,0:25:31.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}说老实话 我还不清楚\N{\rEN\blur0.8}To tell you the truth, I haven't made up my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.32,0:25:35.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我知道你很有办法搞到东西\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I understand you're a man that knows how to get things.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.12,0:25:39.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这方面我是有点本事\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm known to locate certain things from time to time.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.58,0:25:42.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那你能不能帮我弄一把石锤？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I wonder if you might get me a rock hammer.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.79,0:25:44.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}石锤？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-A what?   -A rock hammer.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.54,0:25:47.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-那是什么，为什么要它？  -这你就别管了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-What is it and why?   -What do you care?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.59,0:25:51.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果你要带把牙刷，我才懒得 问这么多 直接开价就得了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, if it was a toothbrush, I wouldn't ask. I'd quote a price.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.42,0:25:53.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}毕竟牙刷不是危险品，对吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But then a toothbrush is a non-lethal object, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.47,0:25:56.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有道理\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Fair enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.31,0:26:00.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}石锤大概有六七英寸那么长\N{\rEN\blur0.8}A rock hammer is about six or seven inches long.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.10,0:26:02.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-看起来就像一把小型鹤嘴锄 一鹤嘴锄？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Looks like a miniature pickax.   -Pickax?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.64,0:26:04.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}雕石头用的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-For rocks.   -Rocks.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.48,0:26:07.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}石英？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Quartz?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.69,0:26:10.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Quartz.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.65,0:26:15.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还有云母 页岩\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And some mica, shale...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.37,0:26:17.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}石灰石\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...limestone.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.83,0:26:19.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以呢？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.95,0:26:21.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我痴迷石头\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So I'm a rock hound.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.21,0:26:25.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一直都有这么个嗜好\N{\rEN\blur0.8}At least I was in my old life. I'd like to be again on a limited basis.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.58,0:26:28.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我看你是想拿它敲人脑袋吧\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Or maybe you'd like to sink your toy into somebody's skull.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.92,0:26:31.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不是 这儿没人找我茬\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, sir. No, I have no enemies here.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.96,0:26:34.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是吗？ 且慢\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No? Wait a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.89,0:26:37.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有传言说\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Word gets around.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.18,0:26:40.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}三姐妹对你可是颇有性趣\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The Sisters have taken quite a liking to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.02,0:26:43.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}特别是包格斯\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Especially Bogs.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.85,0:26:48.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}说我不是同性恋不就行了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't suppose it would help any if I explained to them I'm not homosexual.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.44,0:26:49.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们也不算是\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Neither are they.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.11,0:26:53.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}同性恋也是人 他们不是人\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You have to be human first. They don't qualify.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.08,0:27:02.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}想干就干，根本不管你\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Bull queers take by force. That's all they want or understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.70,0:27:06.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}换我是你，我就在背后多长只眼\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If I were you, I'd grow eyes in the back of my head.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.38,0:27:09.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-谢谢提醒 -这个不收你钱\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Thanks for the advice.   -Well, that's free.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.54,0:27:11.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这下你懂我为什么担心了吧\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You understand my concern.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.67,0:27:15.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就算真遇到事，我也不会用石锤\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If there's any trouble, I won't use the rock hammer, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.22,0:27:19.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那你是想挖地道逃狱？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Then I'd guess you want to escape. Tunnel under the wall, maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.14,0:27:21.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}怎么了 笑什么笑\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Did I miss something? What's so funny?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.22,0:27:25.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}等你看到石锤你就明白了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You'll understand when you see the rock hammer.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.77,0:27:29.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这玩意市价一般是多少？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What's an item like this usually go for?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.19,0:27:31.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}7块钱 随便一个奇石店都有卖\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Seven dollars in any rock-and-gem shop.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.23,0:27:34.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一般我会抽五分之一提成\N{\rEN\blur0.8}My normal markup's 20 percent.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.86,0:27:37.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不过这次属于特别物品\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But this is a specialty item.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.41,0:27:41.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}风险高了 价格也得高 就收你10块钱吧\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Risk goes up, price goes up. Let's make it an even 10 bucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.08,0:27:43.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那就10块\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ten it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.20,0:27:47.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}要我说 这是白费钱\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Waste of money, if you ask me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.50,0:27:48.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}为什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Why's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.21,0:27:53.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这儿的警察都爱突击搜查\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Folks around this joint love surprise inspections.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.84,0:27:56.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}找到就得没收\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They find it, you're going to lose it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.97,0:27:59.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果你被逮到 千万别说你认识我\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If they do catch you with it, you don't know me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.26,0:28:01.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你要是敢跟他们提我的名字 以后就休想跟我再做生意\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You mention my name, we never do business again.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.06,0:28:05.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哪怕再想从我这儿买根鞋带 买颗口香糖都没门，懂了么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Not for shoelaces or a stick of gum. Now you got that?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.98,0:28:07.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}懂了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.77,0:28:10.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢谢 怎么称呼你？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thank you, Mr....
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.02,0:28:12.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}瑞德\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Red.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.82,0:28:14.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我叫瑞德\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Name's Red.   -Red.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.57,0:28:17.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}为什么这么叫？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Why do they call you that?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.95,0:28:23.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}可能因为我是爱尔兰人吧\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Maybe it's because I'm Irish.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.13,0:28:34.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}怪不得有人认为他摆清高\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I could see why some of the boys took him for snobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.88,0:28:37.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他闷声不响的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He had a quiet way about him...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.63,0:28:41.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}走路说话都不是寻常人的路子\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...a Walk and a talk that just wasn't normal around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.14,0:28:43.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他散起步来\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He strolled...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.76,0:28:48.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就像是在公园中漫步 无忧无虑的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}... like a man in the park without a care or a worry in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.18,0:28:52.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就跟身披隐形衣一样， 这里的一切都干扰不到他\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Like he had on an invisible coat that would shield him from this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.32,0:28:57.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不得不说\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, I think it would be fair to say...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.32,0:28:59.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我从一开始就喜欢安迪这小子\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...1 liked Andy from the start.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.32,0:29:04.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}赶快！ 不要误事\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let's go! Some of us got a schedule to keep.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.25,0:29:10.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}快点儿 动作快！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Move it! Come on, move it!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.34,0:29:16.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你好啊，老婆待你如何？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How you doing? How's the wife treating you?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.98,0:29:29.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别歇着\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Keep it moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.23,0:29:35.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}瑞德\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Red.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.42,0:29:55.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}安迪是对的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Andy was right.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.13,0:29:58.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我终于明白他为什么笑了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}! finally got the joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.67,0:30:01.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一个人拿这东西挖地道\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It would take a man about 600 years...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.22,0:30:03.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}估计得600年才能挖通\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...Co tunnel under the wall with one of these.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.51,0:30:10.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-要书吗？  -今天不要\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Book? Not today.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.98,0:30:18.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-要书么？  -不要\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Book? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.78,0:30:21.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, Brooksie.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.32,0:30:26.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}给杜弗伦带的货\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Delivery for Dufresne.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.62,0:30:35.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Book? Pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.29,0:30:38.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}要书吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Book?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.96,0:30:45.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}杜弗伦 你的书到了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Dufresne, here's your book.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.77,0:30:52.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢谢\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.10,0:31:02.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}杜弗伦 漂白水 不够了 你去后面拿\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Dufresne, we're running low on hexite. Get on back and fetch us up some.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.31,0:31:40.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}小心我弄瞎你们\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This will blind you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.23,0:31:43.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}宝贝儿 别出声\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Honey, hush.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.16,0:31:58.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就是这样。你越反抗\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's it. You fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.29,0:31:59.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就越刺激\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Better that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.05,0:32:11.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我也希望安迪能打赢，全身而退\N{\rEN\blur0.8}/ wish I could tell you that Andy fought the good fight...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.30,0:32:13.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而且三姐妹会就此放过他\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...and the Sisters let him be.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.93,0:32:15.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我希望能出现另一种结局\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I wish I could tell you that...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.93,0:32:19.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不过监狱不是童话世界\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...but prison is no fairy-tale world.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.06,0:32:22.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他绝口不提是谁干的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He never said who did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.27,0:32:23.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但我们都知道\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But we all knew.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.70,0:32:31.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这情况持续了-一阵子\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Things went on like that for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.62,0:32:34.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}监狱生活由一系列例行公事组成\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Prison life consists of routine...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.37,0:32:36.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}除了例行公事还是例行公事\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...and then more routine.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.87,0:32:42.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}安迪的身上总有新伤\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Every so often, Andy would show up with fresh bruises.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.88,0:32:45.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}三姐妹就是不放过他\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The Sisters kept at him.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.88,0:32:48.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有时候他能把他们打跑\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sometimes he was able to fight them off.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.18,0:32:49.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有时候不能\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sometimes not.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.89,0:32:53.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}安迪的情况就是这样\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And that's how it went for Andy.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.60,0:32:55.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那是他的例行公事\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That was his routine.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.22,0:32:59.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}入狱头两年绝对是他这辈子最惨的两年\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I do believe those first two years were the worst for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.14,0:33:03.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果事情再这么继续下去\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And I also believe if things had gone on that way...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.86,0:33:06.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他就会被这地方给毁了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...this place would have got the best of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.07,0:33:09.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不过 在1949年春天\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But then, in the spring of 1949...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.03,0:33:12.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}狱方宣布\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...the powers that be decided that:
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.16,0:33:15.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}车牌工厂的屋顶要翻修\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The roof of the license-plate factory needs resurfacing.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.66,0:33:18.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我需要12个人千一礼拜的活\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I need a dozen volunteers for a week's work.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.58,0:33:21.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们都知道\N{\rEN\blur0.8}As you know...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.79,0:33:25.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}特别的差事有特别的待遇\N{\rEN\blur0.8}... special detail carries with it special privileges.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.54,0:33:28.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是户外公差\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It was outdoor detail...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.38,0:33:32.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}五月份外出干活 简直求之不得\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...and May is one damned fine month to be working outdoors.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.09,0:33:34.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}排好队\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Stay in line there.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.39,0:33:37.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一百多人志愿报名\N{\rEN\blur0.8}More than 100 men volunteered for the job.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.85,0:33:44.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}华莱士 E 昂格\N{\rEN\blur0.8}"Wallace E. Unger.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.36,0:33:47.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}艾利斯 瑞丁\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ellis Redding."
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.90,0:33:49.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你说巧不巧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Wouldn't you know it?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.94,0:33:53.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我和我的哥们全都中签了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Me and some fellows I know were among the names called.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.41,0:33:55.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}安迪 杜弗伦\N{\rEN\blur0.8}"Andrew Dufresne."
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.82,0:33:58.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}每人只花了-一包烟就搞定了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It only cost us a pack of smokes per man.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.29,0:34:01.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}当然我还是照例抽两成\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I made my usual 20 percent, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.92,0:34:05.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有个德州的大牌律师打长途给我\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So this big-shot lawyer calls me long-distance from Texas.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.58,0:34:07.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我问：什么事？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I say, "Yeah?"
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.46,0:34:11.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他说：很遗憾 你的兄弟刚刚去世了I\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He says, "Sorry to inform you, but your brother just died."
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.26,0:34:15.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-真遗憾 -有什么好遗憾的，烂人一个\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-I'm sorry to hear that.   -I'm not. He was an asshole.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.34,0:34:17.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好多年前就从家里跑出去 还以为他已经死了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ran off years ago. Figured him for dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.76,0:34:20.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这个律师告诉我说：\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So anyway, this lawyer fellow says to me:
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.27,0:34:24.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他的时候是个大富翁。I1 挖油井什么的。赚了将近100万\N{\rEN\blur0.8}"Your brother died a rich man." Oil wells and shit. Close to a million bucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.10,0:34:27.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}100万？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}A million bucks? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.27,0:34:31.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-真是走了狗屎运 -有你一份不？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Incredible how lucky some assholes get.   -You going to see any of that?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.36,0:34:35.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有我三万五\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thirty-five thousand. That's what he left me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.28,0:34:37.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-美元么？  -可不\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Dollars?   -Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.24,0:34:40.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真棒！ 这不就跟中大奖一样么\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Holy shit, that's great! That's like winning the sweepstakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.58,0:34:41.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.87,0:34:44.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}笨蛋 你当政府是吃干饭的吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Dumb-shit, what do you think the government is gonna do to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.04,0:34:47.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一口分掉一大块， 这就是他们干出来的事\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Take a big wet bite out of my ass is what.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.21,0:34:49.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}可怜虫\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Poor Byron.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.46,0:34:53.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真够倒霉的，哈？ 过路财神\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Terrible fucking luck, huh? Crying shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.80,0:34:56.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有的人就是命衰\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Some people really got it awful.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.34,0:34:57.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}安迪 你疯了么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Andy, are you nuts?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.89,0:34:59.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}专心干活啊！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Keep your eyes on your mop, man! Andy.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.97,0:35:03.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}虽然得缴税 不过也能剩不少\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You'll pay some tax, but you'll still end up--
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.18,0:35:06.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊 可能够我换辆新车 然后呢？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, yeah, maybe enough to buy a new car, and then what?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.15,0:35:08.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我还得给车上税 还有维修\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I got to pay tax on the car. Repair...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.61,0:35:12.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}保养 小孩子们闹着要兜风\N{\rEN\blur0.8}... maintenance, kids pestering you to take them for a ride all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.57,0:35:16.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}要是报税出错，还得自己掏腰包\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Then if you figure your tax wrong, you pay out of your own pocket.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.41,0:35:18.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}告诉你 这就是美国政府\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I tell you! Uncle Sam!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.82,0:35:22.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}蚊子腿上都能劈出肉来\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He puts his hand in your shirt and squeezes your tit till it's purple.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.45,0:35:24.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Andy. Andy. Andy.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.46,0:35:27.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-他这是不想活了 -继续干活\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Getting himself killed.   -Keep tarring.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.88,0:35:30.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么兄弟 都是狗屁！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Some brother. Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.96,0:35:32.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.34,0:35:36.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}海利先生\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mr. Hadley...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.59,0:35:39.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你信任老婆吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...do you trust your wife?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.60,0:35:42.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真有意思\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, that's funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.60,0:35:45.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你用没牙的嘴帮我吹喇叭 肯定更有意思\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You'll look funnier sucking my dick with no teeth.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.44,0:35:48.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我的意思是，她会不会背着你私奔走掉？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What I mean is, do you think she'd go behind your back?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.90,0:35:53.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}莫特 让开 这家伙活的不耐烦了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Step aside, Mert. This fucker's having himself an accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.53,0:35:54.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他要把安迪推下去！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He'll push him off!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.78,0:35:56.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果你信任她\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Because if you trust her, you can keep...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.86,0:35:58.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你就能拿到三万五\N{\rEN\blur0.8}... that 35,000.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.99,0:36:03.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-你说什么？  -三万五\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-What did you say? Thirty-five thousand. Thirty-five thousand.   -All of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.28,0:36:03.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}全部到手
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.29,0:36:06.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-一分不少 -你可别要我\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-All of it?   -Every penny. You better start making sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.79,0:36:09.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}想领全额 就赠与太太\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If you want to keep it, give it to your wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.33,0:36:13.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}国税局允许一生一次， 最多六万的配偶赠予免税\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The IRS allows a one-time-only gift to your spouse for up to $60,000.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.42,0:36:15.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-乖乖 免税？  -免税\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Bullshit. Tax-free?   -Tax-free.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.01,0:36:18.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}国税局一分钱都拿不到\N{\rEN\blur0.8}IRS can't touch one cent.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.43,0:36:20.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你就是那个杀妻的银行家\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're that smart banker what killed his wife, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.05,0:36:24.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我要是相信你 不就落得 和你一个下场了吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Why should I believe a smart banker? So I can end up in here with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.64,0:36:27.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}法律就是这么规定的， 你去问国税局也是一样\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's perfectly legal. Go ask the IRS. They'll say the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.69,0:36:31.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不该开口的， 我以为你自己就会去问\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Actually, I feel stupid telling you this. I'm sure you would have investigated.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.98,0:36:35.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不用你教我这些鸟事\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't need you to tell me where the bear shit in the buckwheat.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.82,0:36:39.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没错 但你要找人帮你办事\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Of course not. But you do need someone to set up the tax-free gift for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.41,0:36:41.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}请律师可得花钱\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That'll cost you. A lawyer, for example.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.24,0:36:43.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那帮没卵的讼棍！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}A bunch of ball-washing bastards!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.95,0:36:47.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我可以帮你办 给你省钱\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I suppose I could set it up for you. That would save you some money.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.58,0:36:49.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你领表格 我来填\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You get the forms, I'll prepare them for you...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.96,0:36:51.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}几乎不用收你钱\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...nearly free of charge.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.92,0:36:56.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我只要求你请我的同事们 每人喝3瓶啤酒\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'd only ask three beers apiece for each of my coworkers.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.17,0:36:59.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}同事 太逗了！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}"Coworkers." That's rich, ain't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.55,0:37:02.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在外头干活的男人要有口酒喝\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I think a man working outdoors feels more like a man...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.26,0:37:05.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}才能觉得自己像个男人。 这只是我个人的看法\N{\rEN\blur0.8}... lf he can have a bottle of suds. That's only my opinion...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.18,0:37:07.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}长官\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...SIr.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.15,0:37:13.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们这帮人看什么看？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What are you jimmies staring at?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.23,0:37:14.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}赶紧干活！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let's go! Work!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.37,0:37:26.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}事情就是这样\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And that's how it came to pass...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.45,0:37:29.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在完工前一天\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...that on the second-to-last day of the job...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.33,0:37:34.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}49年春天 修屋顶的犯人们\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...the convict crew that tarred the factory roof in the spring of '49...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.13,0:37:37.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在早上十点坐在一起\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...wound up sitting in a row at 10:00 in the morning...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.46,0:37:43.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}喝着冰凉的啤酒 还是肖申克州立监狱\N{\rEN\blur0.8}... drinking icy-cold beer, courtesy of the hardest screw...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.14,0:37:46.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}史上最狠的狱警掏的腰包\N{\rEN\blur0.8}... that ever walked a turn at Shawshank State Prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.60,0:37:49.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}娘们儿们，趁着凉快喝\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Drink up while it's cold, ladies.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.18,0:37:54.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这王八蛋还装大方呢\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The colossal prick even managed to sound magnanimous.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.86,0:38:00.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}阳光洒在肩头，仿佛自由人一般\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We sat and drank with the sun on our shoulders and felt like free men.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.70,0:38:04.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们就像是在修自家的屋顶\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hell, we could have been tarring the roof of one of our own houses.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.32,0:38:07.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们像是造物之主般自在\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We were the lords of all creation.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.74,0:38:09.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}至于安迪\N{\rEN\blur0.8}As for Andy...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.54,0:38:12.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他窝在凉荫下\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...he spent that break hunkered in the shade...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.37,0:38:15.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}脸上挂着奇异的微笑\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...a Strange little smile on his face...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.17,0:38:17.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看着我们喝他的啤酒\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...watching us drink his beer.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.80,0:38:26.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}来一瓶？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey. Want a cold one, Andy?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.51,0:38:30.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不了 谢谢 我戒酒了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, thanks. I gave up drinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.40,0:38:37.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你可能会想 他这是想拍狱方的马屁\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You could argue he'd done it to curry a favor with the guards.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.19,0:38:42.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}或者是想和同犯拉关系\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Or maybe make a few friends among us cons.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.74,0:38:43.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我呢\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.95,0:38:46.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我觉得他只是在寻找正常生活的感觉\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I think he did it just to feel normal again...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.24,0:38:49.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}即使只有一小会儿\N{\rEN\blur0.8}... If only for a short while.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.08,0:38:53.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}将军\N{\rEN\blur0.8}King me.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.08,0:38:57.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-国际象棋。帝王的游戏 一啥？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Chess. Now there's a game of kings.   -What?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.88,0:38:59.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}讲文明 重谋略\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Civilized. Strategic.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.30,0:39:03.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}云里雾里的 最烦这一套\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And a total fucking mystery. I hate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.59,0:39:05.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}改天我教你下\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let me teach you someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.89,0:39:07.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好啊\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.35,0:39:10.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们可以找张棋盘一起下\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We could get a board together.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.26,0:39:13.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这下你可找对人了 什么我都弄得到\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're talking to the right man. I can get things, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.56,0:39:17.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}棋盘你去弄 棋子我自己刻\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We might do business on a board, and I'll carve the pieces myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.73,0:39:21.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一边用雪花石膏 一边用皂石 你觉得如何？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}One side in alabaster, the opposing side in soapstone. What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.69,0:39:23.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}得刻好多年吧\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I think it'll take years.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.28,0:39:25.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}时间有的是，缺的是石头\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Years I got. What I don't have are the rocks.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.99,0:39:28.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}操场上的石头没多大挑头\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Pickings are pretty slim in the yard.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.16,0:39:30.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}大多数都是鹅卵石\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Pebbles, mostly.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.37,0:39:37.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}咱们算是朋友吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Andy, we're getting to be kind of friends, aren't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.04,0:39:39.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}算吧\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.25,0:39:41.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}问你个事呗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Can I ask you something?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.26,0:39:44.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}为什么杀人？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Why'd you do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.93,0:39:47.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}瑞德 我可是无辜的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm innocent, Red.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.64,0:39:49.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}大家不都是么\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Just like everybody else here.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.06,0:39:55.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你是怎么进来的？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What are you in for?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.31,0:40:00.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}跟你一样 谋杀\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Murder. Same as you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.65,0:40:01.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你也是无辜的？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Innocent?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.57,0:40:07.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是肖申克监狱唯一的罪人\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Only guilty man in Shawshank.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.71,0:40:21.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}MAN: Perimeter check. North wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.84,0:40:31.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}彼得
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.31,0:40:35.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}班尼
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.55,0:41:07.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}歌女呢？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Where's the canary?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.97,0:41:09.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你怎么知道？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How did you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.47,0:41:11.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-我知道什么？  -原来你不知道\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-How did I know what?   -So you don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.97,0:41:13.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}来\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.68,0:41:17.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}歌女在这里\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is where the canary is, Johnny.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.44,0:41:23.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没想到会有女人来寒舍献唱吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Quite a surprise to hear a woman singing in my house, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.28,0:41:28.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}的确\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's quite a...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.61,0:41:31.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没想到\N{\rEN\blur0.8}... SUrprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.62,0:41:37.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}等等\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Red?   -Wait, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.54,0:41:39.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她上场了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Here she comes.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.29,0:41:42.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我最迷她甩头发的骚样\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is the part I really like, when she does that shit with her hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.33,0:41:45.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我知道 这个月看过三次了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, yeah, I know. I've seen it three times this month.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.29,0:41:47.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}姬旦 你衣着整齐吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Gilda, are you decent?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.21,0:41:49.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.63,0:41:51.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-Oh!   -Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.05,0:41:53.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天 我爱死了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}God, I love it.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.98,0:42:02.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听说阁下有求必应\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I understand you're a man that knows how to get things.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.98,0:42:06.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在下确非浪得虚名. 你要什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, I'm known to locate certain things from time to time. What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.90,0:42:09.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-丽塔 海华丝 -什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Rita Hayworth.   -What?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.61,0:42:11.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}弄得到吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Can you get her?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.41,0:42:15.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这位就是强尼 法罗呀 久仰久仰\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So this is Johnny Farrell. I've heard a lot about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.99,0:42:19.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-要花几周的时间？  -几周？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Take a few weeks.   -Weeks?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.45,0:42:23.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我又没把她压在我裤裆下面\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, I don't have her stuffed down the front of my pants right now, sorry to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.46,0:42:25.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不过还是弄得到的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But I'll get her.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.96,0:42:27.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}放心好了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.21,0:42:30.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.30,0:42:33.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}It was. You should've seen his face.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.43,0:42:34.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Sit down.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.59,0:42:35.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Did you tell him what I'm...?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.93,0:42:37.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Down in front.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.35,0:42:40.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-/ wanted to save that as a surprise.   -Hang on to your hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.06,0:42:42.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}BALLIN: Gilda is my wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.90,0:42:52.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-出去！  -我得放映呀\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Take a walk!   -I got to change the reel!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.11,0:42:55.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}赶紧滚！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I said fuck off!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.24,0:43:02.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}要尖叫么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ain't you going to scream?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.96,0:43:05.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}咱们来算算总帐\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let's get this over with.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.92,0:43:13.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他他妈把我鼻子打破了！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He broke my fucking nose!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.22,0:43:23.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.94,0:43:26.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我要解开拉链\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...I'm going to open my fly...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.35,0:43:29.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}叫你含什么你就含\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...and you'll swallow what I give you to swallow.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.27,0:43:32.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}先舔我，再舔公鸡 因为你打破他鼻子\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Then you'll swallow Rooster's. You broke his nose.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.03,0:43:35.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你欠他 就得还\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I think ye ought to have something to show for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.36,0:43:37.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}它进我的嘴，就跟你分家\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Anything you put it in my mouth, you'll lose it.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.45,0:43:40.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不 你不懂\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, you don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.41,0:43:43.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你敢下口 我就把这个八寸长 的锥子顺着你耳朵扎进去\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Do that and I'll put all eight inches of this steel in your ear.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.62,0:43:47.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧 但你应该知道， 如果脑部突然遭受严重损伤\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All right, but you should know that sudden, serious brain injury...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.29,0:43:49.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}会让人使劲咬下去\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...causes the victim to bite down hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.71,0:43:53.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那力量之大\N{\rEN\blur0.8}In fact, I hear the bite reflex is so strong...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.76,0:43:56.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}要用撬棍\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...they have to pry the victim's jaws open...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.38,0:43:57.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}才打得开\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...with a crowbar.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.76,0:44:02.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你怎么知道？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Where do you get this shit?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.47,0:44:03.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}书上写的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I read it.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.31,0:44:08.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你识字吗 豆腐脑？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know how to read, you ignorant fuck?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.65,0:44:11.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}亲爱的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.69,0:44:14.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你不该这么做！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You shouldn't!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.07,0:44:20.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}包格斯没逼安迪吹喇叭\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Bogs didn't put anything in Andy's mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.24,0:44:22.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他的朋友们也没有\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And neither did his friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.74,0:44:26.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们把安迪打个半死\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What they did do is beat him within an inch of his life.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.25,0:44:29.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}让他在医务室里待了-一个月\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Andy spent a month in the infirmary.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.58,0:44:33.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}包格斯被罚禁闭一周\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Bogs spent a week in the hole.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.22,0:44:38.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}包格斯，时间到\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Time's up, Bogs.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.51,0:44:44.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}老板 你说了算\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's your world, boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.44,0:44:50.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}回房准备晚点名\N{\rEN\blur0.8}MAN: Return to your cellblocks for evening count.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.40,0:44:53.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}全部回房去\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All prisoners report for lockdown.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:08.04,0:45:09.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么事？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.72,0:45:24.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-他往哪儿跑？  -抓住他脚\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Where's he going? Grab his ankles.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.60,0:45:31.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不！ 不！ 救命！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No! No! Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.98,0:45:37.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}从那以后 两件事再也没发生过\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Two things never happened again after that.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.86,0:45:41.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}三姐妹再也不敢动安迪一指头\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The Sisters never laid a finger on Andy again.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.82,0:45:44.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}包格斯再也没法走一步路\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And Bogs never walked again.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.49,0:45:49.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他被转送到北部低戒护水平的医院\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They transferred him to a minimum-security hospital upstate.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.16,0:45:51.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我只知道 他后半辈子\N{\rEN\blur0.8}To my knowledge, he lived out the rest of his days...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.83,0:45:54.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}只能靠吸管来进食了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...drinking his food through a straw.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:55.00,0:45:59.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}咱们得热烈欢迎安迪出院\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Andy could use a nice "welcome back" when he gets out of the infirmary.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.84,0:46:02.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这主意不错\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sounds good to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.68,0:46:05.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}啤酒那事 咱们欠他的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I figure we owe him that much for the beer.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.93,0:46:08.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他喜欢下棋\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The man likes to play chess.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.68,0:46:10.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们帮他找石头吧\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let's get him some rocks.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.22,0:46:44.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}各位！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.22,0:46:46.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我找到一块\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I got one.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.47,0:46:48.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我找到了·一块 看！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I got one. Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.89,0:46:54.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}赫伍 这不是皂石 也不是雪花石膏\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Heywood, that isn't soapstone! And it ain't alabaster either.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.14,0:46:56.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你他妈装什么地质学家？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What are you, a fucking geologist?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.23,0:46:58.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他说的没错，确实不是\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He's right. It ain't.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.19,0:47:01.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-那这玩意到底是什么？  -马粪蛋\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-What the hell is it then? It's a horse apple.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.07,0:47:04.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-扯蛋！  -不是扯蛋，是马屎蛋\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Bullshit! No, horseshit.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.66,0:47:06.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}石化了的马屎蛋\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Petrified.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.66,0:47:13.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}老天\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, Jesus.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.17,0:47:16.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我操！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Damn!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.67,0:47:20.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}尽管错误难免 但毕竟众志成城\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Despite a few hitches, the boys came through in fine style.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.05,0:47:23.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}到安迪出院的那周\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And by the weekend he was due back...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.26,0:47:27.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们攒下的石头已经够他刻一辈子了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...we had enough rocks saved up to keep him busy till rapture.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.84,0:47:30.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那周还到了·一大批货\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Also got a big shipment in that week.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.60,0:47:31.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有香烟\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Cigarettes...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.89,0:47:33.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}口香糖\N{\rEN\blur0.8}... chewing gum...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.14,0:47:34.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}小瓶装威士忌\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...Sipping whiskey...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:34.81,0:47:38.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}裸女扑克牌 应有尽有\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...Pplaying cards with naked ladies on them. You name it.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:38.40,0:47:41.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}当然 最重要的是\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And, of course, the most important item:
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.07,0:47:45.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}丽塔 海华丝\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rita Hayworth herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.43,0:48:11.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}欢迎归来 免费享用
Dialogue: 0,0:48:19.31,0:48:22.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一好了 都打起精神来！ -打开所有楼层\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, look alive! Open all tiers.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.19,0:48:24.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}小心 来查房了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Heads up. They're tossing the cells.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.65,0:48:27.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}小心 来查房了！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Heads up. They're tossing the cells!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.99,0:48:30.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}119房\N{\rEN\blur0.8}119.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.33,0:48:34.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}123房\N{\rEN\blur0.8}123.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.16,0:48:37.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}圣经
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.30,0:48:45.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}起立\N{\rEN\blur0.8}On your feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.92,0:48:49.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}面对墙站好\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Face the wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.54,0:49:25.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}转过头来，面对典狱长\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Turn around and face the warden.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.05,0:49:34.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}很高兴看到你念圣经\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Pleased to see you reading this.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.47,0:49:37.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你最喜欢哪一章节？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Any favorite passages?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:38.27,0:49:40.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}11 所以你们要惊醒\N{\rEN\blur0.8}"Watch ye, therefore, for ye know not...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:40.81,0:49:43.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为不知道家主何时来\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...when the master of the house cometh."
Dialogue: 0,0:49:44.23,0:49:46.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}马可福音 13章35节\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mark 13:35.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.11,0:49:49.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我也一向喜欢那句\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I've always liked that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.90,0:49:51.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不过我更喜欢：\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But I prefer:
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.07,0:49:53.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是世界的光\N{\rEN\blur0.8}"lam the light of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:54.41,0:49:57.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}跟从我的，就不在黑暗里走， 必要得跟着生命的光\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ye that followeth me shall have the light of life."
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.87,0:50:00.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}约翰福音 8章12节\N{\rEN\blur0.8}John, chapter 8, verse 12.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:00.79,0:50:02.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听说你精通数字\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I hear you're good with numbers.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.00,0:50:04.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真好\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.25,0:50:07.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}人应该有专长\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Man should have a skill.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.76,0:50:10.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Wanna explain this?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.93,0:50:16.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}磨石毡 打磨石头用的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's called a rock blanket. For shaping and polishing rocks.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.43,0:50:18.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我的小嗜好\N{\rEN\blur0.8}A little hobby of mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.24,0:50:30.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没什么问题\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's pretty clean.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.94,0:50:34.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这里有点非法物品 无重大违规\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Some contraband here, but nothing to get in a twist over.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.37,0:50:40.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这东西 我不大喜欢\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I can't say I approve of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.00,0:50:43.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不过嘛\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But I suppose...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:45.54,0:50:47.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}破个例也无妨\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...exceptions can be made.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:57.93,0:50:59.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}锁门！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Lock them up!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:02.14,0:51:03.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}差点忘了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I almost forgot.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.14,0:51:06.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我怎么能夺走你的圣经\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'd hate to deprive you of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.06,0:51:09.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}得救之道 就在其中\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Salvation lies within.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:09.15,0:51:10.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是 长官\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.83,0:51:21.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}查房只是借口\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Tossing cells was just an excuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:21.83,0:51:23.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真相是\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Truth is...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.25,0:51:25.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}诺顿要试探他的斤两\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...Norton wanted to size Andy up.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.76,0:51:36.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}主的审判迅速降临
Dialogue: 0,0:51:39.43,0:51:41.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我太太在教会团体织的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}My wife made that in church group.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.44,0:51:45.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}非常精美 长官\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Very nice, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.31,0:51:48.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}喜欢洗衣房的工作吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You enjoy working the laundry?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:50.44,0:51:52.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不怎么喜欢，长官\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, sir. Not especially.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.48,0:51:54.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}也许我们可以\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Perhaps we can find something more...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:55.20,0:51:57.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}找个更适合你发挥才学的岗位\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...befitting a man of your education.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:05.71,0:52:07.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}小杰 老布呢？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, Jake. Where's Brooks?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:07.88,0:52:11.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}安迪 我听见你来了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Andy. I thought I heard you out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:12.46,0:52:14.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们把我安排给你了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I've been reassigned to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.30,0:52:16.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我听说了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I Know, they told me.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:17.47,0:52:19.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真让人想不到呀\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ain't that a kick in the head?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:19.68,0:52:22.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那我就带你小小地参观一-下吧\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, I'll give you the dime tour.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.18,0:52:23.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}来吧\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:24.81,0:52:26.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}都在这儿了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, here she is.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:26.68,0:52:28.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}肖申克监狱图书馆\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The Shawshank Prison Library.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:29.40,0:52:31.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}国家地理杂志\N{\rEN\blur0.8}National Geographics...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:32.32,0:52:35.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}读者文摘精选集\N{\rEN\blur0.8}... Reader's Digest condensed books...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.28,0:52:36.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}畅销西部小说\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...and Louis L'Amour.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:37.49,0:52:39.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}《展望》 杂志\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Look magazine.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.66,0:52:42.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}悬疑小说\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Erle Stanley Gardners.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.24,0:52:45.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}每晚搬上车兜一层卷\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Every evening I load up the cart and make my rounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:45.87,0:52:48.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在剪贴板上记下借书人的名字\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I enter the names on this clipboard here.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.08,0:52:51.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就是这样 简简单单\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Easy, peasy, Japanese-y.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.92,0:52:55.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-有问题吗？  -你管图书馆多久了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Any questions?   -Brooks, how long have you been librarian?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.76,0:53:00.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}1905年入狱，1912年入馆\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh.... I come here in '05, and they made me librarian in 1912.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.01,0:53:04.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这么多年都没有助手？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And have you ever had an assistant?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.35,0:53:06.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没有 根本用不着\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No. Not much to it, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:07.60,0:53:08.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那他们为什么现在派我来？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Why me? Why now?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.27,0:53:10.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不知道\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:10.73,0:53:13.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不过能有个伴儿也挺好的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But it'd be nice to have some company down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:14.15,0:53:15.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Dufresne!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.08,0:53:27.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就是他 你要找的人\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's him. That's the one.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.00,0:53:36.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我叫狄金斯\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm Dekins.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.59,0:53:38.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我在想\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I was...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:38.88,0:53:42.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}为孩子弄个教育基金\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...thinking about setting up some kind of trust fund for my kids' educations.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.10,0:53:48.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我明白了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh. I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.98,0:53:51.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, um....
Dialogue: 0,0:53:53.23,0:53:56.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}咱们坐下谈吧\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Why don't we have a seat and talk it over.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:58.65,0:54:02.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}老布 有纸笔吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Brooks, do you have a piece of paper and a pencil?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:13.71,0:54:15.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢谢\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:15.67,0:54:16.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那么\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So....
Dialogue: 0,0:54:18.50,0:54:20.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}狄金斯先生\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mr. Dekins....
Dialogue: 0,0:54:21.09,0:54:23.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}然后安迪说：狄金斯先生\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And then Andy says, "Mr. Dekins...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.34,0:54:26.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}贵公子是想进哈佛还是耶鲁？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...do you want your sons to go to Harvard or Yale?"
Dialogue: 0,0:54:26.56,0:54:27.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你少瞎扯\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He didn't say that!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.02,0:54:30.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}老天作证！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}As God as my witness!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.77,0:54:32.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他愣了-下\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Dekins just blinked for a second...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:32.64,0:54:35.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}傻笑出来 后来他居然还跟安迪握手了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...then he laughed and actually shook Andy's hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:36.27,0:54:38.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-握你个头啊！  -真的握手了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-My ass! Shook his hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.78,0:54:41.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}跟你说 当时差点把我给乐尿了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I tell you, I near soiled myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.82,0:54:46.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}只要给安迪弄一套西装领带 再在 桌上摆一个扭来扭去的草裙舞小妞\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All he needed was a suit and tie and a jiggly hula gal on his desk...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.32,0:54:49.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他就成了"杜弗伦先生“了 I\N{\rEN\blur0.8}..ne'd have been "Mr. Dufresne," if you please.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:49.12,0:54:50.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}开始交新朋友了 安迪？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Making a few friends, huh, Andy?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:52.08,0:54:53.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}也不算朋友\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I wouldn't say "friends."
Dialogue: 0,0:54:53.92,0:54:57.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我就是个精通理财规划的杀人犯而已\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm a convicted murderer who provides sound financial planning.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:57.96,0:55:00.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这可算个大本事\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's a wonderful pet to have.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:00.51,0:55:02.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}起码你不用再在洗衣房里干活了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Got you out of the laundry, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:02.88,0:55:04.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还派得上更大用场\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It might do more than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:05.01,0:55:07.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们说，扩大一下图书馆， 置办点新书怎么样？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How about expanding the library. Get some new books.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:07.89,0:55:10.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还不如要个台球桌呢\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If you ask for something, ask for a pool table.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:11.31,0:55:15.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你准备怎么做？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Right.   -How do you expect to do that? I mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.35,0:55:18.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}请问杜弗伦先生 你准备怎么买进新书？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...get new books in here, "Mr. Dufresne, if you please."
Dialogue: 0,0:55:18.86,0:55:20.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}找典狱长要钱\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'll ask the warden for funds.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:21.78,0:55:26.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我历经六任典狱长 终于总结出了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Son, son, son, six wardens have been through here in my tenure, and I've learned...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:26.28,0:55:28.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一个亘古不变的真理：\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...one immutable, universal truth:
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.83,0:55:31.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}该加预算的时候，这帮孙子的屁眼\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Not one of them born whose asshole...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:31.24,0:55:35.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一个个绷得比小军鼓还紧\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...wouldn't pucker up tighter than a snare drum when you ask for funds.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:36.25,0:55:39.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-预算太少了 -我了解\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-The budget's stretched thin as it is.   -I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:39.29,0:55:42.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}也许我可以写信跟州议会要钱\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Perhaps I could write the state senate and request funds directly from them.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.92,0:55:47.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}监狱领到款只能做三种用途\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They have only three ways to spend the taxpayers' money for prisons:
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.22,0:55:49.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}筑高墙 加牢笼 添警卫\N{\rEN\blur0.8}More walls, more bars, more guards.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:49.89,0:55:52.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我想尝试一下 请您允许我每周一信\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Still, I'd like to try, with permission. A letter a week.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:52.72,0:55:55.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-他们总不能一直无视我 -谁说他们不能\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-They can't ignore me forever.   -Sure can.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.77,0:55:58.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不过如果你乐意写 我也不拦着\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But you write your letters if it makes you happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:58.77,0:56:01.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你写完我还会帮你寄出去。怎么样？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'll even mail them for you. How's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:03.03,0:56:05.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}安迪开始一周一信\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So Andy started writing a letter a week...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:05.99,0:56:07.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他说话算话\N{\rEN\blur0.8}. Just like he said.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.78,0:56:14.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不过 就像诺顿说的那样\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And, just like Norton said...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:14.58,0:56:16.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}安迪的信石沉大海\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...Andy got no answers.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:24.30,0:56:29.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}到四月时，安迪已经在给肖申克 监狱的一半狱警代办退税手续了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The following April, Andy did tax returns for half the guards at Shawshank.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:30.55,0:56:32.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一年后 全狱的狱警都来找他帮忙\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Year after that, he did them all...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.06,0:56:35.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}连典狱长都不例外\N{\rEN\blur0.8}..Including the warden's.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:36.73,0:56:40.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}再过一年 狱际棒球赛\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Year after that, they rescheduled the intramural season...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:40.36,0:56:42.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}也改到与纳税季重叠的日子了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...CO coincide with tax season.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.40,0:56:48.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}各监狱的狱警都带着税单找他\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The guards on the opposing teams all remembered to bring their W-2s.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:49.03,0:56:52.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这么说来，莫尔斯比监狱\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So Moresby Prison issued you a gun, but you actually paid for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.57,0:56:52.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}为你配发了枪支 但需要你自己出钱
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.12,0:56:54.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没错 枪套也是自掏腰包\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Damn right. The holster too.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:54.95,0:56:57.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这属于可减税项目 可以省下这笔钱\N{\rEN\blur0.8}See, that's tax-deductible. You can write that off.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.62,0:57:00.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没错，安迪就像是一个 常年开张的家庭手工作坊\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes, sir. Andy was a regular cottage industry.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:01.42,0:57:06.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}事实上 在税季繁忙的 时候，他还可以请助手\N{\rEN\blur0.8}In fact, it got so busy at tax time, he was allowed a staff.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:06.17,0:57:08.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}能递给我一叠1040表格么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Could you hand me a stack of 1040s?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.80,0:57:13.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}每年都有一个月 我可以离开 木工工厂 简直让我心里乐开了花\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Got me out of the wood shop a month out of the year, and that was fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:14.97,0:57:18.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}至于信 他还是在继续写\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And still, he kept sending those letters.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:21.94,0:57:24.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Red. Red. Andy.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:24.86,0:57:25.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}老布出事了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's Brooks.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:27.03,0:57:28.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}当心门\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Watch the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:28.78,0:57:30.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}老布 别这样\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Please, Brooks.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:30.28,0:57:32.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-你他妈冷静点 -退后！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Calm the fuck down.   -Stay back!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:32.62,0:57:35.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-都给我退后！  -怎么回事？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Stay back, goddamn it!   -What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:34.99,0:57:38.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}本来好好的 突然就亮刀子\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You tell me. One second he's fine, then out come the knife.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:38.16,0:57:40.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}老布 有话好说\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Brooks. We can talk about this, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:40.25,0:57:44.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没什么好说的 我他妈一刀割了他\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There's nothing to talk about. I'll cut his fucking throat.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.29,0:57:46.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他怎么惹你了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What's he done to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:46.17,0:57:47.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不是他 是他们！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's what they done!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:48.38,0:57:49.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我没得选\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I got no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:50.13,0:57:52.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你不会伤害赫伍的 我们都知道\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Brooks, you won't hurt Heywood. We all know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:52.64,0:57:55.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-对吧 赫伍？  -没错，我知道\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Right, Heywood?   -Sure. I know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:55.35,0:57:58.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他是你们的朋友 老布是个讲道理的人\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He's a friend of yours, and Brooks is a reasonable man.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:58.85,0:58:00.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}大家说对吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Right, guys?   -Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:00.98,0:58:03.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}把刀放下 老布 看着我\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So put the knife down. Brooks, look at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:03.69,0:58:07.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}把刀放下\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Put the knife down. Brooks.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:07.90,0:58:10.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天 你看看他脖子\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Look at his neck, for God's sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:10.74,0:58:13.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看看他脖子 都流血了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Look at his neck. He's bleeding.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.99,0:58:15.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是唯一\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's the only--
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.62,0:58:17.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}唯一可以继续留在监狱的办法了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's the only way they'd let me stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:18.00,0:58:20.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}太疯狂了 你不该这么做\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on, this is crazy. You don't want to do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.54,0:58:22.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}放下 把刀放下\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Put it-- Put it down.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:30.09,0:58:33.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}放轻松\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey. Hey. Take it easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:33.59,0:58:35.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你不会有事的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You'll be all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:35.30,0:58:37.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他不会有事？ 谁来问问我？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Him? What about me?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.97,0:58:40.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这老疯狗差点割断我喉咙！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Crazy old fool damn near cut my throat!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:40.56,0:58:42.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你刮胡子流的血都比这个多\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You've had worse from shaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:42.69,0:58:44.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你哪里惹到他了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What did you do to set him off?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:44.69,0:58:47.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没啊 我就是来道个别\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Nothing. I come in here to say farewell.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:47.86,0:58:50.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们没听说么？ 他的假释申请批下来了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ain't you heard? His parole's come through.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:52.74,0:58:55.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我实在搞不明白\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I just don't understand what happened in there, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:55.82,0:58:58.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}老家伙疯得跟粪坑里的耗子一样\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Old man's crazy as a rat in a tin shithouse.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:58.83,0:59:00.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你住嘴吧\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, Heywood, that's enough out of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.91,0:59:03.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-听说你吓得拉了一裤子 -去你妈的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Heard he had you shitting in your pants. Fuck you.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:03.96,0:59:05.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别斗嘴了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Knock it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:06.13,0:59:07.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}老布没疯\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Brooks ain't no bug.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:07.96,0:59:09.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}He's just--
Dialogue: 0,0:59:11.42,0:59:13.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他只是被体制化了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He's just institutionalized.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:14.55,0:59:16.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}体制个毛啊\N{\rEN\blur0.8}"Institutionalized," my ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:16.64,0:59:20.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}赫伍 他在这儿呆了50年了 50年了！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The man's been in here 50 years, Heywood, 50 years!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:20.85,0:59:22.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他只知道这里\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is all he knows.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:22.77,0:59:25.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在这儿 他是个重要人物\N{\rEN\blur0.8}In here, he's an important man...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:25.27,0:59:26.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是个受过教育的角色\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...an educated man.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.23,0:59:29.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}到了外面 他什么都不是\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Outside, he's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.02,0:59:33.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就是个风烛残年的囚犯 双手还都有关节病\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Just a used-up con with arthritis in both hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.70,0:59:36.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就连申请个借书证没准都会被拒签\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Probably couldn't get a library card if he tried.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:36.99,0:59:38.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这么说 你能懂么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know what I'm trying to say?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:38.99,0:59:42.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我才不信你的满嘴屁话\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I do believe you're talking out of your ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:43.16,0:59:45.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你爱信什么信什么\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You believe whatever you want, Floyd.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:46.00,0:59:48.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不过我跟你讲，监狱的围墙很有意思\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But I tell you these walls are funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:50.00,0:59:51.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}最初你憎恨它\N{\rEN\blur0.8}First you hate them.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:53.51,0:59:55.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}后来你就习惯了它\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Then you get used to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:57.34,0:59:59.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}足够多的时间过去之后\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Enough time passes...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:00.01,1:00:02.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你就离不开它\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...you get so you depend on them.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:03.02,1:00:05.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这就叫"体制化 I1\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's "institutionalized."
Dialogue: 0,1:00:05.39,1:00:09.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}狗屁\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Shit. I could never get like that.   -Oh, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:06.90,1:00:09.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-我才不会呢 一是吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:00:10.56,1:00:13.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}等你在这儿待的时间有老布那么长再说吧\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Wait till you've been here as long as Brooks.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:13.32,1:00:14.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}说的太对了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Goddamn right.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:17.45,1:00:19.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}被判无期徒刑\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They send you here for life...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:20.03,1:00:22.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}等于交出一生\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...that's exactly what they take.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:24.12,1:00:26.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}至少得交出一部分\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Part that counts, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.71,1:00:36.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}小杰 我没法再照顾你了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I can't take care of you no more, Jake.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:37.84,1:00:39.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}走吧\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You go on now.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.72,1:00:42.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你自由了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're free.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:43.52,1:00:45.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}自由了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're free.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:01.45,1:01:03.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Bye. Joe?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.08,1:01:05.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}祝你好运 老布\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Good luck, Brooksie.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:08.08,1:01:10.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}珍重 老布\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Take care of yourself, Brooks.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:43.74,1:01:45.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}亲爱的同犯们：\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Dear fellas:
Dialogue: 0,1:01:45.49,1:01:49.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}外头的世界变化的真快啊\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I can't believe how fast things move on the outside.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:51.00,1:01:53.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看着点路，老东西！ 找死么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Watch it, old-timer! Want to get killed?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:54.92,1:01:58.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}小时候我只见过一辆汽车\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I saw an automobile once when I was a kid...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:59.05,1:02:01.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如今满街都是了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...but now they're everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:05.14,1:02:09.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}整个世界忙成一团\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The world went and got itself in a big damn hurry.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:25.28,1:02:29.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}上面安排我住在这个名叫\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The parole board got me into this halfway house...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:29.33,1:02:31.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}酿酒师"的小客栈\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...called "The Brewer"...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:31.21,1:02:32.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还为我安排了·一份工作\N{\rEN\blur0.8}..and a job...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:32.54,1:02:35.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在富得味超市当包装工\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...bagging groceries at the Food-Way.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:37.09,1:02:39.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}工作很辛苦 我努力不落后太多\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's hard work and I try to keep up...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:39.67,1:02:42.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但是双手一直犯疼\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...but my hands hurt most of the time.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:42.38,1:02:47.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}叫他务必用双层袋\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Make sure your man double-bags. Last time, the bottom near came out.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:44.55,1:02:46.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}上次差点撑破袋子
Dialogue: 0,1:02:47.26,1:02:50.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听这位女士的话 用双层袋，懂了么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Make sure you double-bag like the lady says. Understand?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:50.35,1:02:51.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是的 先生 没问题\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes, sir. Surely will.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:51.94,1:02:55.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我觉得店长不怎么喜欢我\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't think the store manager likes me very much.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:58.52,1:03:02.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有时下班后 我会去公园喂鸟\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sometimes after work, I go to the park and feed the birds.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.24,1:03:04.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我一直在盼着\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I keep thinking...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:04.99,1:03:08.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}小杰能出现 和我打个招呼\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...Jake might just show up and say hello.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:08.91,1:03:11.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不过他再也没出现过\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But he never does.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:12.12,1:03:17.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不管他在何处 我祝他 过的好 能交到新朋友\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I hope, wherever he is, he's doing okay and making new friends.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:20.59,1:03:23.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我晚上总睡不着\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I have trouble sleeping at night.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:23.63,1:03:26.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}老是做噩梦，梦到从高处掉下来\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I have bad dreams, like I'm falling.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:27.18,1:03:29.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}醒来以后恐惧莫名\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I wake up scared.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:29.56,1:03:33.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有时候，我得想好一会儿 才能明白自己在哪\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sometimes it takes me a while to remember where I am.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:35.35,1:03:40.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}也许我应该弄支枪抢劫 富得味超市 这样我就能回家了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Maybe I should get me a gun and rob the Food-Way so they'd send me home.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:40.57,1:03:44.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}抢劫的时候还可以顺手 崩了店长 算是锦上添花吧\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I could shoot the manager while I was at it. Sort of like a bonus.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:46.57,1:03:50.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我太老了 经不起那种折腾了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I guess I'm too old for that sort of nonsense anymore.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:50.74,1:03:52.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不喜欢这里\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't like it here.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:52.70,1:03:56.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}担惊受怕的日子我受够了 我决定\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm tired of being afraid all the time. I've decided...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:57.58,1:03:59.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不要继续留下去了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...Not to stay.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:10.14,1:04:12.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}像我这样的老坏蛋\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I doubt they'll kick up any fuss...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:12.89,1:04:16.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就算死掉 应该也没什么人会在乎吧\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...not for an old crook like me.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:03.44,1:05:05.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}老布 到此一游
Dialogue: 0,1:05:18.87,1:05:23.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}像我这样的老坏蛋，！就算死掉， 应该也没什么人会在乎吧\N{\rEN\blur0.8}"I doubt they'll kick up any fuss, not for an old crook like me.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:24.17,1:05:28.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}又及：转告赫伍 我曾经拿刀 抵住他的脖子 非常过意不去\N{\rEN\blur0.8}P.S. Tell Heywood I'm sorry I put a knife to his throat.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:28.17,1:05:30.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}让他不要怀恨在心。老布留\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No hard feelings. Brooks."
Dialogue: 0,1:05:41.02,1:05:43.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他还不如死在肖申克好\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He should have died in here.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:48.53,1:05:50.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你他妈都干了当些什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What the fuck have you done?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:50.11,1:05:52.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一片混乱 只能这么说\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's a goddamn mess, I'll tell you that.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:58.37,1:06:02.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-这都是什么？  -你说呢？ 这都是寄给你的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-What's all this?   -You tell me. They're addressed to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:03.38,1:06:04.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}拿着\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Take it.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:13.22,1:06:14.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}I1 亲爱的杜弗伦先生：\N{\rEN\blur0.8}"Dear Mr. Dufresne:
Dialogue: 0,1:06:15.89,1:06:17.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}鉴于你一再询问\N{\rEN\blur0.8}In response to your repeated inquiries...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:18.02,1:06:22.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}本州特拨款给贵图书馆 I\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...the state has allocated the enclosed funds for your library project."
Dialogue: 0,1:06:23.06,1:06:24.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}金额两百元\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is $200.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:25.06,1:06:29.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}此外 图书馆所在地区特慷慨捐赠\N{\rEN\blur0.8}"In addition, the library district has generously responded...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:29.28,1:06:31.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}旧书及杂物若干\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...with a donation of used books and sundries.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:32.03,1:06:36.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}相信可满足阁下之要求。就此结案\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We trust this will fill your needs. We now consider the matter closed.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:36.37,1:06:38.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}请勿再来信 11\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Please stop sending us letters."
Dialogue: 0,1:06:38.45,1:06:41.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}典狱长回来前清干净\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I want all this cleared out before the warden gets back.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:41.37,1:06:42.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是 长官\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:46.79,1:06:48.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}干得好 安迪\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Good for you, Andy.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:50.84,1:06:52.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Wow.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:53.26,1:06:55.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}只用了6年\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It only took six years.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:56.76,1:06:59.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}从现在起 我一周两信\N{\rEN\blur0.8}From now on, I'll write two letters a week instead of one.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:59.68,1:07:03.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你还真是固执的可以。 照他说的把东西清理好\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I believe you're crazy enough. Get this stuff out...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:03.31,1:07:05.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我得去撇个条了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...like he said. I've got to pinch a loaf.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:05.90,1:07:07.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我回来的时候\N{\rEN\blur0.8}When I come back...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:07.56,1:07:09.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你应该已经完事了 对吧\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...this is all gone, all right?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:36.68,1:07:38.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}色情漫画
Dialogue: 0,1:07:58.16,1:07:59.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你听到了吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Do you hear that?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:08.27,1:09:11.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}杜弗伦！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Dufresne! Dufresne!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:11.98,1:09:13.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}安迪 让我出去！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Andy, let me out!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:20.41,1:09:25.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}直到今天 我也没搞明白那两位 意大利女士唱的究竟是什么意思\N{\rEN\blur0.8}/ have no idea to this day what those two Italian ladies were singing about.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:25.62,1:09:27.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}其实我也不想明白\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Truth is, I don't want to know.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:28.04,1:09:30.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}此时无声胜有声\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Some things are best left unsaid.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:34.13,1:09:36.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我愿意相信 这是一种美到极致的东西\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I like to think it was something so beautiful...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:37.05,1:09:39.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}无法用言语来表达\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...It can't be expressed in words...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.38,1:09:42.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}美到令人心碎\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...and makes your heart ache because of it.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:43.97,1:09:46.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}歌声直入云霄\N{\rEN\blur0.8}! tell you, those voices soared...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:46.77,1:09:51.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}超越了所有失意囚徒的梦想\N{\rEN\blur0.8}... higher and farther than anybody in a gray place dares to dream.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:51.23,1:09:54.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}宛如一只美丽的鸟儿 飞入了单调的牢房\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It was like a beautiful bird flapped into our drab cage...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:54.77,1:09:57.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}使四周的墙壁消失无踪\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...and made those walls dissolve away.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:58.03,1:10:00.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就在这一瞬间\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And for the briefest of moments...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:00.40,1:10:03.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}肖申克的囚徒们仿佛重获自由\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...every last man at Shawshank felt free.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:05.99,1:10:08.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不过典狱长却因此大为光火\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It pissed the warden off something awful.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:09.96,1:10:11.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}把门打开\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Open the door.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:13.88,1:10:15.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}开门！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Open it up!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:16.96,1:10:19.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}杜弗伦 开门！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Dufresne, open this door!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:21.01,1:10:22.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}把它关掉！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Turn that off!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:29.31,1:10:31.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我警告你，把它关掉！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I am warning you. Turn that off!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:45.66,1:10:47.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Dufresne.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:49.50,1:10:51.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你这是敬酒不吃吃罚酒\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're mine now.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:58.46,1:11:01.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为这个小小事件！ 安迪被罚禁闭两周\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Andy got two weeks in the hole for that little stunt.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:01.84,1:11:03.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}起立\N{\rEN\blur0.8}On your feet.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:04.68,1:11:07.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一嘿 看看谁来了 -大指挥家！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, look who's here. Maestro!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:07.30,1:11:08.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:08.85,1:11:12.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你没别的可放吗？ 比如汉克 威廉姆斯的歌？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You couldn't play something good, huh? Like Hank Williams?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:12.85,1:11:15.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还没来得及接受点播就被逮了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They broke the door down before I could take requests.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:15.81,1:11:19.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-被关两周值得么？  -是我最舒服的两周了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Was it worth two weeks?   -Easiest time I ever did.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:19.15,1:11:23.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-什么话 单独禁闭最难熬了 -在禁闭室待一周感觉跟一年似的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No such thing as easy time in the hole. A week in the hole is like a year.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:23.53,1:11:26.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-说的真他妈对 -有莫扎特先生陪着我\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Damn straight.   -I had Mr. Mozart to keep me company.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:27.03,1:11:30.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们让你带电唱机进去？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So they let you tote that record player down there, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:32.50,1:11:33.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在这儿呢\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It was in here.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:34.71,1:11:36.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在脑中 在心底\N{\rEN\blur0.8}In here.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:37.04,1:11:39.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这就是音乐的美妙之处\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's the beauty of music. They...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:39.34,1:11:41.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是他们夺不走的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...can't get that from you.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:45.22,1:11:47.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们对音乐难道没这种体会吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Haven't you ever felt that way about music?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:49.39,1:11:52.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我年轻的时候倒是吹过口琴\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, I played a mean harmonica as a younger man.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:53.56,1:11:55.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不过后来就没兴致了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Lost interest in it, though.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:55.44,1:11:57.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在牢里也没意义\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Didn't make much sense in here.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:57.40,1:11:59.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就是在牢里才有意义\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Here's where it makes the most sense.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:59.94,1:12:02.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有音乐 才不会忘记\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You need it so you don't forget.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:02.57,1:12:03.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}忘记什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Forget?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:04.15,1:12:07.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}世上\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Forget that there are...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:07.41,1:12:08.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有些地方\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...places...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:09.41,1:12:13.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不是由冷冰冰的石头砌成的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...1N the world that aren't made out of stone.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:14.25,1:12:15.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在人的.\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There's something...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:16.08,1:12:17.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}内心\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...Inside...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:17.75,1:12:19.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有他们\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...that they can't get to...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:19.88,1:12:21.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}无法染指的东西\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...that they can't touch.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:21.80,1:12:23.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是完全属于你的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's yours.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:24.76,1:12:26.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你指的是什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:27.43,1:12:28.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}希望\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hope.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:29.72,1:12:31.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}希望\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hope.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:32.97,1:12:35.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}朋友 我告诉你\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let me tell you something, my friend.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:35.77,1:12:38.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}希望是个危险的东西\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hope is a dangerous thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:39.27,1:12:41.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}希望可以把人逼疯\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hope can drive a man insane.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:42.32,1:12:44.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在牢里 希望没什么用处\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's got no use on the inside.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:44.61,1:12:46.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你最好认命\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You'd better get used to that idea.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:49.36,1:12:50.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}像老布那样吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Like Brooks did?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:16.23,1:13:17.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}坐下\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sit down.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:22.56,1:13:25.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你被判无期徒刑！ 已服刑30年\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Says here that you've served 30 years of a life sentence.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:27.03,1:13:29.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你改过自新了吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You feel you've been rehabilitated?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:29.28,1:13:30.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是的 确实如此\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:31.82,1:13:33.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}毫无疑问\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Without a doubt.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:34.33,1:13:36.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我可以坦诚地说 我已经洗心革面了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I can honestly say I'm a changed man.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:38.71,1:13:40.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不会再去危害社会\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No danger to society here.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:41.17,1:13:42.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}上帝为证\N{\rEN\blur0.8}God's honest truth.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:45.30,1:13:47.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我已经完全改过自新了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Absolutely rehabilitated.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:50.68,1:13:51.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}驳回
Dialogue: 0,1:13:57.35,1:13:58.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}30年\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thirty years.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:00.69,1:14:02.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天 不知说些什么才好\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Jesus, when you say it like that...
Dialogue: 0,1:14:03.44,1:14:05.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这30年都是怎么过去的？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You wonder where it went.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:07.69,1:14:09.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我连前10年是怎么过的都已经不记得了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I wonder where 10 years went.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:14.82,1:14:15.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}拿去\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Here.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:16.28,1:14:19.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}假释被拒小礼物\N{\rEN\blur0.8}A little parole-rejection present.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:20.29,1:14:22.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}打开看看\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Go ahead and open it.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:23.08,1:14:25.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}找你同行弄的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Went through one of your competitors.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:25.29,1:14:28.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}希望你不会介意。 我只想给你个惊喜\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I hope you don't mind. I wanted it to be a surprise.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:38.52,1:14:40.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}漂亮极了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's very pretty, Andy.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:41.73,1:14:42.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢谢\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:45.48,1:14:47.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不吹一曲吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You going to play it?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:51.53,1:14:52.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:56.41,1:14:57.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在不吹\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Not right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:15.47,1:15:16.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}进房！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Roll in!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:29.94,1:15:33.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}新到的女郎 献给十周年庆 -瑞德留
Dialogue: 0,1:15:52.80,1:15:54.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}熄灯！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Lights out!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:28.63,1:16:30.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}安迪言出必行\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Andy was as good as his word.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:31.13,1:16:33.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}每周写两封信\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He wrote two letters a week instead of one.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:35.97,1:16:40.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}1959年 州参议院终于意识到\N{\rEN\blur0.8}In 1959, the state senate finally clued in to the fact...
Dialogue: 0,1:16:40.30,1:16:43.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}区区两百元无法让安迪停笔\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...they couldn't buy him off with just a $200 check.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:43.60,1:16:48.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}拨款委员会投票决定每年支付五百元\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Appropriations Committee voted an annual payment of $500...
Dialogue: 0,1:16:48.10,1:16:50.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好让安迪停笔\N{\rEN\blur0.8}.. Just to shut him up.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:50.19,1:16:53.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你很难想象安迪的能耐有多大\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And you'd be amazed how far Andy could stretch it.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:53.40,1:16:56.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他接洽图书俱乐部，慈善团体\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He made deals with book clubs, charity groups.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:56.53,1:16:59.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}论斤买入旧书\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He bought remaindered books by the pound...
Dialogue: 0,1:16:59.86,1:17:01.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}《金银岛》\N{\rEN\blur0.8}"Treasure Island."
Dialogue: 0,1:17:01.91,1:17:03.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}罗伯特 路易斯\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Robert Louis--
Dialogue: 0,1:17:03.41,1:17:04.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}史蒂文森\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Stevenson.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:04.66,1:17:06.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}小说 冒险类\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Fiction, adventure.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:08.62,1:17:09.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}下一本是什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What's next?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:09.83,1:17:13.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我这儿有汽车维修\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I got here Auto Repair...
Dialogue: 0,1:17:13.67,1:17:14.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还有肥皂雕刻\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...and Soap Carving.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:15.00,1:17:18.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}专业技术及嗜好 教育类，在你后面\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Trade skills and hobbies. Under "Educational," behind you.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:18.42,1:17:20.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}《基基山恩仇记》\N{\rEN\blur0.8}"Count of Monte Crisco."
Dialogue: 0,1:17:20.80,1:17:23.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是"基度山 饭桶\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's "Cristo," you dumb-shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:24.22,1:17:25.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}作者 亚历山大\N{\rEN\blur0.8}By Alexandree...
Dialogue: 0,1:17:25.68,1:17:28.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}大种马\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...DUM-ass. Dumb-ass.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:30.60,1:17:31.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}大种马？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Dumb-ass?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:34.57,1:17:37.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}大仲马 知道是讲什么的吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Dumas. Know what that's about?   -Huh.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:38.82,1:17:40.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你会喜欢的 是讲越狱的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You'd like it. It's about a prison break.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:40.95,1:17:44.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那该归入教育类啰？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We ought to file that under "Educational" too, oughtn't we?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:45.74,1:17:49.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}大伙都尽力帮助安迪\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The rest of us did our best to pitch in when and where we could.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:50.42,1:17:52.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}到肯尼迪遇刺那年\N{\rEN\blur0.8}By the year Kennedy was shot...
Dialogue: 0,1:17:52.38,1:17:57.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}安迪已经把一间散发着臭味的储藏室\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...Andy had transformed a storage room smelling of turpentine...
Dialogue: 0,1:17:57.26,1:18:00.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}变成了新英格兰最棒的监狱图书馆\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...Into the best prison library in New England...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:01.05,1:18:04.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}甚至还有汉克 威廉姆斯的音乐精选\N{\rEN\blur0.8}... complete with a fine selection of Hank Williams.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:11.35,1:18:13.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就在同年 典狱长诺顿\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That was also when Warden Norton...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:13.44,1:18:16.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}开始实施著名的"狱外劳役"计划\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...Instituted his famous "Inside Out" program.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:16.90,1:18:19.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}也许你曾在报上看过\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You may remember reading about it.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:19.20,1:18:22.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他登上了各大报纸 《展望》 杂志还刊发了他的照片\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It made the papers and got his picture in Look magazine.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:22.45,1:18:23.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这并不是狱方的放任自流之举\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's no free ride...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:23.95,1:18:27.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而是悔过自新领域的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...but rather a genuine progressive advance...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:27.41,1:18:30.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一次卓有成效的进步\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...IN corrections and rehabilitation.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:30.29,1:18:32.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}服刑人员将在妥善的监督下\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Our inmates, properly supervised...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:32.96,1:18:35.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}前往监狱之外参加工作\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...Will be put to work outside these walls...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:35.79,1:18:39.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}服务各项公共事业\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...performing all manner of public service.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:39.09,1:18:42.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们将学到诚实劳动的价值\N{\rEN\blur0.8}These men can learn the value of an honest day's labor...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:42.09,1:18:46.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}同时还将为社区提供卓有成效的服务\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...wWhile providing a valuable service to the community...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:46.10,1:18:50.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对于纳税大众而言 也只需花费最少的代价\N{\rEN\blur0.8}..and at a bare minimum of expense to Mr. and Mrs. John Q. Taxpayer.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:51.27,1:18:53.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}当然 他没有告诉媒体的是\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Of course he didn't tell the press...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:53.77,1:18:57.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}最少的代价"是相当不确切的说法\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...that "bare minimum of expense" is a fairly loose term.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:57.44,1:19:00.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}指油的方法何止百种\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There are 100 different ways to skim off the top.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:00.65,1:19:03.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}人力 物料 漏洞数不胜数\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Men, materials, you name it.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:03.53,1:19:06.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}油水之丰厚令人咂舌\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And oh, my Lord, how the money rolled in!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:06.62,1:19:09.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你的报价会害得我倒闭的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-You'll put me out of business.   -Ned.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:09.33,1:19:13.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你有这么多奴工 谁还争得过你\N{\rEN\blur0.8}With this pool of slave labor, you can underbid any contractor in town.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:14.38,1:19:17.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们这是在提供卓有价值的社区服务\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We're providing a valuable community service.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:17.50,1:19:22.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这话登在报纸上确实 很漂亮 但我还得养家\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's fine for the papers, but I've got a family to feed. Sam.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:23.88,1:19:25.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你看我们这么久的交情\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We go back a long way, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:26.72,1:19:31.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我急需包下这条高速公路 搞不定这个 我就只能喝西北风了 千真万确\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I need this new highway contract. I don't get it and I go under. That's a fact.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:32.56,1:19:34.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是内人特地为你烤的美味馅饼\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You have some of this fine pie...
Dialogue: 0,1:19:34.65,1:19:38.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}考虑考虑吧\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...my missus made especially for you. You think about that.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:46.20,1:19:48.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别担心这项工程合约\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ned, I wouldn't worry too much about this contract.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:49.16,1:19:52.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我会带着我的小伙子们去其他地方干活的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It seems to me I already got my boys committed elsewhere.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:54.21,1:19:57.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}请务必代我感谢梅熙夫人 烤制的这份精美馅饼\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You be sure and thank Maisie for this fine pie.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:58.38,1:20:00.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在每一桩交易背后\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And behind every shady deal...
Dialogue: 0,1:20:00.88,1:20:03.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}每一笔黑钱底下\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...behind every dollar earned...
Dialogue: 0,1:20:03.76,1:20:06.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}都有安迪在 是他做的帐\N{\rEN\blur0.8}... there was Andy, keeping the books.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:07.22,1:20:08.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有两笔款要存入银行\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Two deposits.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:08.68,1:20:12.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}缅因州银行和新英格兰第一银行 各一笔，照旧在夜间存入，先生\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Maine National and New England First. Night drops as always, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:43.09,1:20:47.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}把东西拿去洗衣房 两套 西装干洗 还有一包杂物\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Get my stuff to the laundry. Two suits for dry-clean and a bag of whatnot.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:47.88,1:20:51.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-衬衫别浆太硬 否则有他们好看\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If they over-starch my shirts again, they'll hear from me.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:51.01,1:20:53.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我看着怎么样？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Yes, Sir.   -How do I look?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:53.97,1:20:56.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一很好 -我要去波特兰参加一个盛大的慈善活动\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Very nice.   -Big charity to-do up Portland way.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:56.64,1:20:58.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}州长也会出席\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Governor will be there.   -Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:59.60,1:21:01.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}剩下的你要吃么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You want the rest of this?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:02.44,1:21:04.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}烤的难吃透顶\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Woman can't bake worth shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:05.61,1:21:06.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢谢 先生\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thank you, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:09.78,1:21:13.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我听说 这种"馅饼"他收过很多\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He's got his fingers in a lot of pies, from what I hear.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:13.16,1:21:18.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你听说的只是皮毛而已 重重的回扣\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He's got scams you haven't even dreamed of. Kickbacks on his kickbacks.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:18.21,1:21:20.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}黑钱像条河一般在他脚下流淌\N{\rEN\blur0.8}A river of dirty money running through here.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:20.75,1:21:24.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}贪污这么多迟早会曝光\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sooner or later, he'll have to explain where it came from.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:24.80,1:21:26.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这时候就用得到我了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's where I come in.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:27.22,1:21:29.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我处理黑钱，先过滤 后漂白\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I channel it. Filter it. Funnel it.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:29.68,1:21:32.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}股票 证券 免税市政公债\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Stocks, securities, tax-free municipals.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:32.89,1:21:36.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我把脏钱放进市场， 等钱流回来的时候.\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I send it out into the real world, and when it comes back....
Dialogue: 0,1:21:36.60,1:21:39.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-就跟处女的私处一样干净？  -比那还要干净\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Clean as a virgin's honeypot, huh?   -Cleaner.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:40.19,1:21:43.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}到诺顿退休的时候， 我会一手把他变成百万富翁\N{\rEN\blur0.8}By the time Norton retires, I'll have made him a millionaire.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:46.15,1:21:50.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果被人觉察到，他也会 穿着带号码的囚服被关进这里\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If they ever catch on, he'll wind up in here wearing a number himself.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:50.74,1:21:53.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你这么不相信我的手段吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I thought you had more faith in me than that.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:53.62,1:21:56.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我知道你很厉害 不过这么多文件 迟早会走漏点蛛丝马迹的吧\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I Know you're good, but all that paper leaves a trail.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:57.04,1:21:58.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}/旦有人起疑\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now anybody gets curious--
Dialogue: 0,1:21:59.00,1:22:01.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不管是联邦调查局 国税局还是别的什么\N{\rEN\blur0.8}FBI, IRS, whatever.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:01.92,1:22:03.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}总有人会遭殃\N{\rEN\blur0.8}--it'll lead to somebody.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:03.38,1:22:07.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是肯定的，不过那个人不会 是我，也肯定不会是典狱长\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sure it is, but not to me, and certainly not to the warden.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:11.68,1:22:12.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那会是谁？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All right, who?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:12.80,1:22:14.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}兰道 史蒂文斯\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Randall Stevens.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:14.93,1:22:16.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谁？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Who?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:16.10,1:22:18.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}无名又无形的合伙人\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The "silent" silent partner.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:18.31,1:22:21.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他是银行账户的所有者 他是替罪羊\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He's the guilty one, the man with the bank accounts.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:21.56,1:22:23.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他是洗钱活动的源头\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's where the filtering process starts.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:23.94,1:22:26.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}I旦出事 只有他会被追踪到\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They trace anything, it'll just lead to him.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:27.44,1:22:28.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那他是谁？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But who is he?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:28.82,1:22:32.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他是幻影 幽灵 兔宝宝的远房表亲\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He's a phantom, an apparition. Second cousin to Harvey the Rabbit.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:33.95,1:22:35.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我凭空\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I conjured him...
Dialogue: 0,1:22:35.28,1:22:36.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一手把他捏造出来\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...out of thin air.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:37.49,1:22:40.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他压根不存在 除了在文件上\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He doesn't exist, except on paper.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:43.29,1:22:45.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哪有凭空造人的？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Andy, you can't just make a person up.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:45.84,1:22:49.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}当然有 利用制度的漏洞就行\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sure you can, if you Know how the system works.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:49.46,1:22:52.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}靠写信能办成太多的事\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's amazing what you can accomplish by mail.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:52.63,1:22:55.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}史蒂文斯先生有出生证明\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mr. Stevens has a birth certificate...
Dialogue: 0,1:22:55.43,1:22:57.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}驾驶执照 社保卡号\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...driver's license, Social Security number.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:57.89,1:22:58.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你是在蒙我吧\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're shitting me.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:59.02,1:23:02.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就算他们能抓到蛛丝马迹\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If they trace any accounts, they'll wind up chasing...
Dialogue: 0,1:23:02.60,1:23:04.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}也只是捕风捉影而已\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...a figment of my imagination.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:04.52,1:23:06.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真想不到\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, I'll be damned!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:07.90,1:23:09.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我称赞过你吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Did I say you were good?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:10.03,1:23:11.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}靠 你简直是大艺术家伦勃朗\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Shit, you are Rembrandt.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:12.40,1:23:14.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有意思的是\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The funny thing is...
Dialogue: 0,1:23:14.28,1:23:18.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在外头，我我刚正不阿\N{\rEN\blur0.8}..on the outside, I was an honest man, straight as an arrow.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:18.83,1:23:21.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}进了监狱才能大搞手段\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I had to come to prison to be a crook.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:30.05,1:23:31.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你心安吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ever bother you?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:32.76,1:23:35.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我没干坏事，只是洗钱而已\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't run the scams. I just process the profits.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:36.09,1:23:38.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这其中的界限也许相当微妙\N{\rEN\blur0.8}A fine line, maybe...
Dialogue: 0,1:23:38.68,1:23:40.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不过我也建起了图书馆\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...but I also built that library...
Dialogue: 0,1:23:40.89,1:23:44.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还帮助很多狱友考取高中文凭\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...and used it to help guys get their high school diploma.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:44.14,1:23:46.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}典狱长凭什么任我做这些？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Why do you think he lets me do all that?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:46.56,1:23:48.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}为了让你开心 好继续帮他洗钱\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Keep you happy and doing the laundry.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:48.98,1:23:50.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}以前是代人填表，现在是替人洗钱\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Money instead of sheets.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:50.86,1:23:53.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是个廉价劳力 这是笔交易\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, I work cheap. That's the tradeoff.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:10.71,1:24:13.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}汤米 威廉姆斯在1965年来到肖申克\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Tommy Williams came to Shawshank in 1965...
Dialogue: 0,1:24:13.59,1:24:15.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}犯了"破闯"罪 判了两年\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...on a two-year stretch for B and E.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:16.05,1:24:18.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就是"破坏加闯入"的意思\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's breaking and entering to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:18.64,1:24:22.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他在商店后门偷电视时被逮\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Cops caught him sneaking TV sets out the back door of a JC Penney.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:23.31,1:24:24.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}庞克青年\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Young punk.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:24.77,1:24:26.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}摇滚先生\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mr. Rock 'n' Roll...
Dialogue: 0,1:24:26.60,1:24:28.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}自大狂\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...cocky as hell.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:28.35,1:24:30.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}快点 各位老兄 别慢吞吞的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on, old boys. Moving like molasses!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:30.98,1:24:32.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们这样我看着难受\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Making me look bad.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:32.94,1:24:34.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他可以说是人见人爱\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We liked him immediately.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:34.99,1:24:38.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我退出门外 这样抱着电视\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm backing out the door and I got the TV like this.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:39.07,1:24:42.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那家伙又大又笨，挡得我什么都 看不见，然后我就听到有人在\N{\rEN\blur0.8}A big old thing. I couldn't see shit. Then I hear this voice.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:43.33,1:24:45.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别动 小子 举起手来\N{\rEN\blur0.8}"Freeze, kid, hands in the air."
Dialogue: 0,1:24:45.46,1:24:50.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我就站在那儿 手里抱着电视 他又说：\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I was standing there, holding onto that TV. Finally the voice says:
Dialogue: 0,1:24:50.13,1:24:54.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}小子 听懂了吗？ 我说：长官 我听懂了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}"You hear what I said, boy?" I say, "Yes, sir. I sure did.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:54.13,1:24:57.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不过我要是松开手让这玩意掉到地上 又得多担一条毁坏财务罪\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But if I drop this, you get me on destruction of property too."
Dialogue: 0,1:25:02.14,1:25:04.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你在凯希曼监狱蹲过？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, you done some stretch in Cashman, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:04.93,1:25:08.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那是最好混的日子\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, that was an easy piece of time, let me tell you.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:09.19,1:25:11.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}周末回家 外役制度\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Weekend furloughs. Work programs.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:11.81,1:25:13.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}跟这儿可不一样\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Not like here.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:13.19,1:25:15.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你好像哪里都蹲过嘛\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sounds like you done time all over.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:15.44,1:25:17.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我从13岁起就以牢为家了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, I've been in and out since I was 13.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:17.99,1:25:20.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你想的到的监狱我都待过\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You name it, chances are I've been there.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:20.41,1:25:23.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}也许你该改行了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Perhaps you should try a new profession.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:24.54,1:25:26.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我的意思是\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What I mean is...
Dialogue: 0,1:25:26.46,1:25:29.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你做贼的技术实在 不怎么样，还是干点别的好\N{\rEN\blur0.8}... you're not a very good thief. You should try something else.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:30.12,1:25:33.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你懂个屁 你是卡彭呀？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, what the hell you know about it, Capone?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:33.75,1:25:35.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你因为什么进来的？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What are you in for?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:35.63,1:25:36.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Me?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:39.05,1:25:40.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}被律师给坑了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}A lawyer fucked me.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:44.64,1:25:47.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}肖申克人人都是无辜的 不懂吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Everybody's innocent in here. Don't you know that?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:55.52,1:25:59.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}后来我们知道，汤米有个年轻的妻子 还有刚出生不久的女儿\N{\rEN\blur0.8}As it turned out, Tommy had himself a young wife and a new baby girl.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:00.49,1:26:02.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他怕妻女流落街头\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Maybe he thought of them on the streets...
Dialogue: 0,1:26:02.78,1:26:05.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}或者孩子长大后不认识爸爸\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...Or his child growing up not knowing her daddy.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:05.62,1:26:07.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不管出于什么原因\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Whatever it was...
Dialogue: 0,1:26:07.33,1:26:09.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这小子决定搏一把\N{\rEN\blur0.8}... something lit a fire under that boy's ass.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:13.58,1:26:16.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我想考同等学力高中文凭\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thought I might try for my high school equivalency.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:16.63,1:26:19.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听说你帮着不少人考上了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hear you helped a couple of fellas with that.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:20.55,1:26:22.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我从来不在废物身上浪费时间 汤米\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't waste time with losers, Tommy.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:24.18,1:26:26.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我他妈才不是废物\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I ain't no goddamn loser.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:28.43,1:26:30.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-你认真的？  -认真的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-You mean that?   -Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:31.94,1:26:33.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真的吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You really mean that?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:34.40,1:26:35.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一点不错\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes, sir, I do.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:35.90,1:26:37.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好 /-旦开始努力\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Good. Because if we do this...
Dialogue: 0,1:26:38.07,1:26:42.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就得努力到底 竭尽全力 不能半途而废\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...we do it all the way, a hundred percent, nothing half-assed.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:42.28,1:26:44.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}问题是\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thing is, see...
Dialogue: 0,1:26:45.41,1:26:46.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不太识字\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...I don't read so good.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:48.12,1:26:49.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是"大 不是"太I\N{\rEN\blur0.8}"Well."
Dialogue: 0,1:26:51.21,1:26:53.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你不大\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You don't read...
Dialogue: 0,1:26:53.12,1:26:54.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}识字\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...SO well.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:57.04,1:26:58.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}以后再细讲\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We'll get to that.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:02.93,1:27:05.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}安迪把汤米收归门下\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So Andy took Tommy under his wing.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:05.30,1:27:08.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}从ABC开始教起\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Started walking him through his ABC's.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:10.10,1:27:12.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}汤米学得很不错\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Tommy took to it pretty well too.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:12.56,1:27:15.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他从来没发现过自己这么有天分\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Boy found brains he never knew he had.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:17.65,1:27:21.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没过多久，安迪就开始帮助他准备考试了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Before long, Andy started him on his course requirements.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:21.28,1:27:23.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他很喜欢这孩子\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He really liked the kid.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:23.11,1:27:26.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}助人向上让他感到兴奋\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Gave him a thrill to help a youngster crawl off the shit heap.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:27.24,1:27:29.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不过这并不是他唯一的目的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But that wasn't the only reason.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:30.20,1:27:32.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}牢狱生活枯燥漫长\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Prison time is slow time.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:32.87,1:27:35.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}必须找事来做打发时间\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So you do what you can to keep going.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:35.83,1:27:37.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有人集邮\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Some fellas collect stamps.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:38.30,1:27:40.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有人搭火柴屋\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Others build matchstick houses.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:41.34,1:27:44.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}安迪建起了一座图书馆\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Andy built a library.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:44.51,1:27:46.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在他需要一个新的计划\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now he needed a new project.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:47.34,1:27:48.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这个新计划就是汤米\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Tommy was it.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:49.47,1:27:53.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这跟他长年刻石一样\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It was the same reason he spent years shaping and polishing those rocks.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:54.02,1:27:57.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}也跟他挂美女图一样\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The same reason he hung his fantasy girlies on the wall.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:58.15,1:27:59.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在牢里\N{\rEN\blur0.8}In prison...
Dialogue: 0,1:27:59.69,1:28:03.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没事也得找事做\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...a man will do most anything to keep his mind occupied.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:04.20,1:28:09.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}1966年 就在汤米应考之前\N{\rEN\blur0.8}By 1966, right about the time Tommy was getting ready to take his exams...
Dialogue: 0,1:28:09.28,1:28:11.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}海报女郎已经换成拉寇儿 薇芝了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}..It was lovely Raquel.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:28.05,1:28:29.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}时间到\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Time.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:35.06,1:28:36.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}怎么样？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:37.69,1:28:39.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}怎么样？ 屎一样\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, it's for shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:40.32,1:28:43.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这狗屁玩意白费我一整年\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I wasted a whole year of my time with this bullshit.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:43.32,1:28:44.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}也许没那么糟糕\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's probably not that bad.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:45.03,1:28:49.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我一题都没答对，这题目 干脆换用中文来出算了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, I didn't get a thing right. It might as well have been in Chinese.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:49.45,1:28:51.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}分数出来再说\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let's see how the score comes out.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:51.37,1:28:54.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我他妈这就告诉你我得了几分\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, well, I'll tell you how the goddamn score comes out.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:56.33,1:28:57.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}两分命中！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Two points, right there!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:57.87,1:28:59.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这他妈就是总分！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There's your goddamn score!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:59.71,1:29:03.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么狗屁小猫爬树，五五二十五\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Goddamn cats crawling up trees, 5 times 5 is 25....
Dialogue: 0,1:29:04.34,1:29:06.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}去他妈的这个地方！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Fuck this place!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:06.22,1:29:07.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}去他妈的！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Fuck it!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:26.49,1:29:27.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我感觉很糟\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I feel bad.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:27.90,1:29:29.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我让他失望了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I let him down.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:29.32,1:29:31.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}孩子 别瞎说\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's crap, kid.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:31.24,1:29:32.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他以你为荣\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He's proud of you.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:32.95,1:29:35.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}多年的交情，我摸透他了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We're old friends, I Know him as good as anybody.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:36.00,1:29:37.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他是个聪明人 对吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Smart fellow, ain't he?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:37.75,1:29:41.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}绝顶聪明 他在外头是个银行家\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Smart as they come. He was a banker on the outside.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:41.08,1:29:43.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那他到底为什么进来的？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What's he in here for anyway?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:43.67,1:29:44.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谋杀\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Murder.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:46.13,1:29:49.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你少扯了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-The hell, you say.   -Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:49.63,1:29:52.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看他外表你绝对想不到\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You wouldn't think it to look at the guy.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:53.22,1:29:57.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}抓到他老婆跟高尔夫球 教练在床上搞，两个全打死了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Caught his wife in bed with some golf pro. Greased them both.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:05.32,1:30:06.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}怎么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:07.65,1:30:10.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}大约4年前\N{\rEN\blur0.8}About four years ago...
Dialogue: 0,1:30:10.49,1:30:13.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我在托马斯顿监狱服刑\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...I was in Thomaston on a two-to-three stretch.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:14.24,1:30:15.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}罪名是偷车\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I stole a car.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:15.91,1:30:18.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这事儿简直蠢透了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It was a dumb-fuck thing to do.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:18.58,1:30:20.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}刑期剩下半年的时候\N{\rEN\blur0.8}About six months left to go...
Dialogue: 0,1:30:21.12,1:30:23.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}来了个新室友\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...I get a new cellmate in.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:23.71,1:30:25.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}埃尔默 布拉齐\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Elmo Blatch.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:26.05,1:30:27.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}大个子 紧张得要死\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Big, twitchy fucker.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:28.26,1:30:31.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这种室友谁摊上谁倒霉，你懂吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Kind of roomie you pray you don't get. You know what I'm saying?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:31.93,1:30:34.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}武装行窃 服刑6到12年\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Six-to-twelve, armed burglary.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:34.97,1:30:37.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他说他干过好几百票\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Said he pulled hundreds of jobs.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:37.39,1:30:42.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}很难相信会有那样的人，明明又高又壮 你放个响点的屁他都能一跳三尺高\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hard to believe, high-strung as he was. You cut a loud fart, he jumped three feet.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:43.44,1:30:48.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他讲起话来就收不住嘴\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Talked all the time too. That's the other thing. He never shut up.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:48.23,1:30:49.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}讲他去过的地方\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Places he'd been in...
Dialogue: 0,1:30:50.20,1:30:53.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}犯过的案子 干过的女人\N{\rEN\blur0.8}.. jobs he'd pulled, women he fucked.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:53.53,1:30:55.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}连杀过的人也拿出来说\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Even people he killed.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:56.95,1:30:59.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他说他杀人是因为\N{\rEN\blur0.8}People who "gave him shit."
Dialogue: 0,1:31:00.37,1:31:02.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别人"让他不爽\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's how he put it.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:03.21,1:31:06.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这件事就跟个笑话一样，有天晚上\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So one night, like a joke...
Dialogue: 0,1:31:07.71,1:31:11.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我问他"埃尔默 你杀过谁？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...I say to him, "Yeah, Elmo, who did you kill?"
Dialogue: 0,1:31:11.47,1:31:12.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他说\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So he says:
Dialogue: 0,1:31:12.72,1:31:16.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那时候我在乡村俱乐部干整理桌子的活\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I got me this job one time, busing tables at a country club...
Dialogue: 0,1:31:17.39,1:31:21.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这样我就能知道谁是有钱的混蛋\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...8O I could case all these big rich pricks that come in.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:23.40,1:31:25.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我看中了-一个人\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So I pick out this guy...
Dialogue: 0,1:31:26.31,1:31:27.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在晚上\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...go in one night...
Dialogue: 0,1:31:28.02,1:31:29.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}摸进他家\N{\rEN\blur0.8}..and do his place.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:31.24,1:31:32.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他醒过来\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He wakes up...
Dialogue: 0,1:31:33.32,1:31:35.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}惹得我不爽\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...and gives me shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:36.16,1:31:37.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我就宰了他\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So I killed him.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:39.58,1:31:42.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}连他身边那骚货也一起宰了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Him and this tasty bitch he was with.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:43.83,1:31:46.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}最有意思的来了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And that's the best part.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:46.75,1:31:49.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她和这个高尔夫教练搞上了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She's fucking this prick, see...
Dialogue: 0,1:31:49.38,1:31:52.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不过她是个有夫之妇\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...this golf pro, but she's married to some other guy.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:53.09,1:31:55.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}丈夫还是个大银行家\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Some hotshot banker.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:57.10,1:31:59.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}黑锅就让他丈夫给背了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And he's the one they pinned it on.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:11.11,1:32:15.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我得承认 这是我听过的最惊人的故事\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I have to say that's the most amazing story I ever heard.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:16.24,1:32:18.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}最惊人的是 你居然信了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What amazes me most is you'd be taken in by it.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:19.45,1:32:20.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sir?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:21.45,1:32:26.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}显然 威廉这家伙对你有点好感\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, it's obvious this fellow Williams is impressed with you.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:26.88,1:32:30.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}知道你过得不好，自然就想让你高兴\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He hears your tale of woe and naturally wants to cheer you up.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:30.96,1:32:33.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他还年轻，脑子不是太管用\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He's young, not terribly bright.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:33.72,1:32:37.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他根本不明白 他其实坑苦了你\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's not surprising he wouldn't know what a state he put you in.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:37.55,1:32:39.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他讲的是真话\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sir, he's telling the truth.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:39.89,1:32:44.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就算真有布拉齐这个人\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, let's say for the moment this Blatch does exist.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:44.31,1:32:49.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}难道他会跪下来哭着说 没错，就是我干的，我悔罪\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You think he'd just fall to his knees and cry, "Yes, I did it. I confess.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:49.10,1:32:51.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}顺便再给我加个无期徒刑"？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, and by the way, add a life term to my sentence."
Dialogue: 0,1:32:52.02,1:32:55.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有了汤米的证词 我的案子就能重审\N{\rEN\blur0.8}With Tommy's testimony, I can get a new trial.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:55.03,1:32:57.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}前提是布拉齐还在监狱里\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's assuming Blatch is even still there.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:57.78,1:32:59.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}很可能他已经被释放了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Chances are, he'd be released by now.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:59.87,1:33:04.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但能查到他的住址和亲友 这是个机会 对吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They'd have his last known address, names of relatives. It's a chance, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:06.83,1:33:08.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你这人怎么这么迟钝？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How can you be so obtuse?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:09.50,1:33:10.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:12.00,1:33:13.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你说我什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What did you call me?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:13.63,1:33:15.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}说你迟钝 是你故意装出来的吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Obtuse. Is it deliberate?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:15.80,1:33:17.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别忘了你的身份\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're forgetting yourself.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:17.63,1:33:20.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}乡村俱乐部肯定留着他的考勤卡\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The country club will have his old timecards.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:20.72,1:33:23.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}记录 税单 上面都有他的名字\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Records, W-2s with his name on them.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:23.68,1:33:26.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你沉迷于自己的幻想，那是你的事\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If you want to indulge this fantasy, it's your business.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:26.60,1:33:29.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别给我添麻烦 面谈结束\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't make it mine. This meeting is over.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:29.40,1:33:32.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我要是能出狱，绝对不会提这儿的事\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sir, if I got out, I'd never mention what happens here.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:32.69,1:33:35.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为我帮你洗钱，和你同罪\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'd be as indictable as you for laundering that money.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:36.69,1:33:40.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别再跟我提钱，你个小兔崽子！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't ever mention money to me again, you sorry son of a bitch!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:40.62,1:33:42.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在哪儿\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Not in this office...
Dialogue: 0,1:33:42.49,1:33:44.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}都不许说 进来！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...Not anywhere. Get in here, now!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:44.70,1:33:47.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我只想让你安心 仅此而已\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I just wanted to put you at ease, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:48.04,1:33:50.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-单独禁闭。  -个月 -遵命\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Solitary. A month.   -Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:50.25,1:33:53.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-你这人有病吗？  -把他带走\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-What's the matter with you?   -Get him out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:53.25,1:33:56.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是我出狱的机会！ 我的人生！ 你不懂吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is my chance to get out! It's my life! Don't you understand?!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:57.01,1:33:59.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}把他带走！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Get him out!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:00.88,1:34:02.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}关小黑屋一个月\N{\rEN\blur0.8}A month in the hole.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:03.01,1:34:05.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没听说过这么久的禁闭\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's the longest stretch I ever heard of.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:05.93,1:34:07.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}都是我害了他\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's all my fault.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:07.43,1:34:09.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别扯了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, bullshit.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:09.73,1:34:12.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}当初扣扳机的不是你， 给他定罪的也不是你\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You didn't pull the trigger or convict him.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:12.60,1:34:15.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你是说安迪没罪？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Are you saying Andy is innocent?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:15.19,1:34:17.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真的没罪？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean, for real innocent?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:17.44,1:34:18.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看来是这样\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It looks that way.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:19.24,1:34:21.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我的天\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sweet Jesus.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:21.41,1:34:23.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他在这儿待多久了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How long has he been here now?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:23.66,1:34:27.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}1947年进来的 算多少？ 有19年了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}1947. What is that? Nineteen years.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:27.16,1:34:29.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-威廉 托马斯的信 -在这儿\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Williams, Thomas. Yeah, over here.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:35.59,1:34:36.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What you got?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:37.42,1:34:38.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}教育委员会发来的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Board of Education.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:38.88,1:34:40.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}老家伙把考卷寄出去了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That son of a bitch mailed it.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:40.63,1:34:44.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你是要拆开看看还是站着傻等？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You going to open it or stand there with your thumb up your butt?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:44.80,1:34:47.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我觉得还是站着傻等比较好\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thumb up my butt sounds better.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:47.52,1:34:50.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}史基 还给我 你个痞子\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, Skeet, come on. Give me that, you shithead.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:51.19,1:34:52.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}福洛 别这样\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Floyd, come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:55.19,1:34:56.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, Red.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:57.94,1:35:00.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}把它丢掉 好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Will you throw that away, please?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:05.95,1:35:07.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真不错\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:20.38,1:35:23.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那小子考上了 平均成绩C+\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The kid passed. C-plus average.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:23.34,1:35:25.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}给你报个喜\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thought you'd like to know.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:41.69,1:35:43.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}典狱长找你谈话\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Warden wants to talk.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:56.92,1:35:58.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在这儿？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Out here?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:58.13,1:36:00.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他就是这么说的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's what the man said.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:16.52,1:36:20.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}典狱长？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Warden? Tommy?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:25.99,1:36:31.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这次对话你要对外保密\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Tommy, I'm asking you to keep this conversation just between us.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:33.12,1:36:35.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我感到事情有点不对劲\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I feel awkward enough as it is.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:53.85,1:36:55.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在出了点状况\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We got a situation here.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:56.77,1:36:58.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我想你能明白\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I think you can appreciate that.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:59.02,1:37:00.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:00.56,1:37:02.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我明白\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I sure can.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:02.23,1:37:06.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}跟你讲 小子 这事真的让我很震惊\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I tell you, son, this thing really came along and knocked my wind out.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:07.74,1:37:10.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}实话说 害得我晚上连觉都睡不好\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's got me up nights. That's the truth.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:12.58,1:37:14.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有时候我自己也不清楚\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The right thing to do...
Dialogue: 0,1:37:16.08,1:37:19.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}应该怎么做才好\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...sometimes it's hard to know what that is.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:20.84,1:37:22.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你明白吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Do you understand?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:24.59,1:37:26.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}小子 帮我一把\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I need your help, son.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:27.59,1:37:29.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在我行动之前\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If I'm going to move on this...
Dialogue: 0,1:37:30.09,1:37:33.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不希望有任何不确定因素\N{\rEN\blur0.8}... there can't be the least little shred of doubt.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:34.02,1:37:35.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我想知道\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I have to know...
Dialogue: 0,1:37:35.22,1:37:37.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你对杜弗伦说过的话 属实吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...lf what you told Dufresne was the truth.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:38.06,1:37:39.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}千真万确\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:39.40,1:37:40.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}句句属实\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Absolutely.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:41.19,1:37:44.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你愿不愿意手按圣经\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Would you be willing to swear before a judge and jury...
Dialogue: 0,1:37:44.36,1:37:46.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在法官和陪审团面前起誓\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...with your hand on the Good Book...
Dialogue: 0,1:37:46.57,1:37:49.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在全能的上帝面前作证？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...and take an oath before Almighty God himself?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:49.40,1:37:51.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}机会一到，我绝不迟疑\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Just give me that chance.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:55.54,1:37:56.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我也是这样想\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's what I thought.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:43.96,1:38:45.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}相信你已经听说了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm sure by now you've heard.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:47.63,1:38:48.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真够惨的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Terrible thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:50.26,1:38:51.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这么年轻的小伙子\N{\rEN\blur0.8}A man that young...
Dialogue: 0,1:38:52.05,1:38:54.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}只剩一年刑期了 还试图逃走\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...less than a year to go, trying to escape.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:55.18,1:38:57.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}海利队长痛下决心才开枪射杀他\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Broke Captain Hadley's heart to shoot him.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:58.43,1:39:00.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真的是这样\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Truly, it did.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:02.94,1:39:05.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们能做的就是忘掉这件事\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We just have to put it behind us.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:07.02,1:39:08.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}继续生活\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Move on.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:09.86,1:39:11.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不干了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm done.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:12.70,1:39:14.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就此收手\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Everything stops.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:16.28,1:39:18.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}找别人帮你洗钱吧\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Get someone else to run your scams.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:19.87,1:39:21.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没有收手这一说\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Nothing stops.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:23.04,1:39:24.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}做了就不能停\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:27.63,1:39:30.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}否则我要你生不如死\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Or you will do the hardest time there is.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:31.13,1:39:33.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不再让警卫保护你\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No more protection from the guards.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:33.63,1:39:38.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不让你继续住你的豪华单间 把你和鸡奸狂分到一起\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'll pull you out of that one-bunk Hilton and cast you down with the sodomites.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:39.97,1:39:42.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}日日夜夜轮奸不休\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You'll think you've been fucked by a train.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:43.81,1:39:45.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}图书馆？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And the library?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:45.98,1:39:47.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Gone.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:47.56,1:39:50.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}用砖一块块封死\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sealed off, brick by brick.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:50.61,1:39:53.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们就在操场中间 用书当柴火办个烧烤宴会\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We'll have us a little book barbecue in the yard.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:53.45,1:39:55.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}火光几英里外都能看见\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They'll see the flames for miles.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:55.78,1:39:58.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们围着火堆跳印第安舞\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We'll dance around it like wild Injuns.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:59.91,1:40:03.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}懂了吗？ 明白没？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You understand me? Catching my drift?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:06.67,1:40:08.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}再说我迟钝试试？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Or am I being obtuse?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:20.31,1:40:23.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}再关他一个月 让他考虑考虑\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Give him another month to think about it.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:09.69,1:41:12.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我老婆曾经说过 她很难了解我\N{\rEN\blur0.8}My wife used to say I'm a hard man to know.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:13.57,1:41:15.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她说我就像一本合上的书\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Like a closed book.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:16.20,1:41:18.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她整天这么抱怨我\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Complained about it all the time.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:19.16,1:41:20.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她很美\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She was beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:23.16,1:41:25.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我多么爱她啊\N{\rEN\blur0.8}God, I loved her.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:28.37,1:41:30.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我只是不擅长表达而已\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I didn't Know how to show it, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:33.34,1:41:35.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}瑞德 害死她的是我\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I killed her, Red.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:36.88,1:41:38.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}扣扳机的人不是我\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I didn't pull the trigger...
Dialogue: 0,1:41:40.14,1:41:41.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但逼她走上这条路的人就是我\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...but I drove her away.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:43.35,1:41:46.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她就是这么死的 因为我.\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's why she died, because of me...
Dialogue: 0,1:41:46.18,1:41:47.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是我的品性不够好，害了她\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...the way lam.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:56.65,1:41:58.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但你不是杀人犯\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That don't make you a murderer.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:01.87,1:42:03.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}至多不能算是好丈夫\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Bad husband, maybe.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:07.25,1:42:10.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你想后悔就后悔去 但是凶手不是你\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Feel bad about it if you want, but you didn't pull the trigger.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:10.67,1:42:12.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}确实不是\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, I didn't.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:12.46,1:42:14.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是其他人动的手\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Somebody else did.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:15.63,1:42:17.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但是我却进来了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And I wound up in here.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:20.22,1:42:21.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}大概是我倒霉了吧\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Bad luck, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:24.76,1:42:28.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这种事情\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Yeah.   -It floats around.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:29.48,1:42:31.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}摊上谁都有可能\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's got to land on somebody.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:32.60,1:42:34.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}只是这次让我给碰上了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It was my turn, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:35.23,1:42:38.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就像龙卷风一样 让我给撞上了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I was in the path of the tornado.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:43.91,1:42:47.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}只是没想到 这场龙卷风能持续这么久\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I just didn't expect the storm would last as long as it has.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:52.25,1:42:54.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你觉得你还能出去吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Think you'll ever get out of here?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:55.17,1:42:56.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Me?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:59.17,1:43:00.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}能啊\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:01.51,1:43:03.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}等我哪天长出长长的白胡子\N{\rEN\blur0.8}One day, when I got a long, white beard...
Dialogue: 0,1:43:03.97,1:43:08.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}老到神志不清 他们就放我出去了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...and two or three marbles rolling around upstairs, they'll let me out.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:09.22,1:43:10.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我跟你说我要去哪儿\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I tell you where I'd go.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:12.31,1:43:14.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}芝华塔尼欧\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Zihuatanejo.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:14.86,1:43:16.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你说什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Say what?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:16.36,1:43:18.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}芝华塔尼欧\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Zihuatanejo.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:19.11,1:43:20.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在墨西哥\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's in Mexico.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:22.15,1:43:24.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}太平洋边的小地方\N{\rEN\blur0.8}A little place on the Pacific Ocean.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:25.45,1:43:28.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-知道墨西哥人怎样说太平洋的吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know what the Mexicans say about the Pacific?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:28.45,1:43:32.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没有回忆的海洋\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-No.   -They say it has no memory.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:34.00,1:43:36.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我要在那度过余生\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's where I want to live the rest of my life.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:38.30,1:43:40.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没有回忆的温暖地方\N{\rEN\blur0.8}A warm place with no memory.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:44.05,1:43:46.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就在海滩上\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Open up a little hotel...
Dialogue: 0,1:43:47.68,1:43:49.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}开个小旅馆\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...fight on the beach.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:49.81,1:43:52.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}买条不值钱的破船\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Buy some worthless old boat...
Dialogue: 0,1:43:52.52,1:43:54.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}整修一新\N{\rEN\blur0.8}.and fix it up new.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:56.90,1:43:58.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}载客出海\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Take my guests out...
Dialogue: 0,1:43:58.98,1:44:00.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}包船海钓\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...charter fishing.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:04.16,1:44:05.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}芝华塔尼欧\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Zihuatanejo.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:09.45,1:44:13.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}到了那种地方 我还是会需要 一个知道怎么搞到东西的人\N{\rEN\blur0.8}In a place like that, I could use a man that knows how to get things.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:19.84,1:44:22.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我在外头吃不开的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't think I could make it on the outside, Andy.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:29.35,1:44:31.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我大半辈子都耗在肖申克\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I been in here most of my life.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:32.85,1:44:34.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}早已经被体制化了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm an institutional man now.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:35.52,1:44:37.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就跟老布一样\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Just like Brooks was.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:37.98,1:44:40.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别小看自己\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, you underestimate yourself.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:41.02,1:44:42.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我可不觉得\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:46.45,1:44:50.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在牢里 我能让你有求必应\N{\rEN\blur0.8}In here I'm the guy who can get things for you, sure, but...
Dialogue: 0,1:44:51.16,1:44:53.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}到了外面 你翻翻电话簿 就能把事办成了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...outside all you need is the Yellow Pages.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:53.83,1:44:56.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}喉 那玩意我都不知道该怎么查\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hell, I wouldn't know where to begin.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:58.25,1:44:59.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}太平洋？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Pacific Ocean?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:00.29,1:45:01.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}狗屁\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:01.88,1:45:04.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那么大的东西 我会吓死\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Scare me to death, something that big.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:04.26,1:45:05.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我倒不会\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Not me.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:06.80,1:45:09.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我没开枪射杀我老婆，也没射杀她情夫\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I didn't shoot my wife, and I didn't shoot her lover.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:11.30,1:45:14.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我犯下的错已经偿清\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Whatever mistakes I made, I've paid for them and then some.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:15.56,1:45:17.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一间旅店 一艘小船\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That hotel, that boat....
Dialogue: 0,1:45:18.85,1:45:21.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这种要求并不过份\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't think that's too much to ask.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:25.99,1:45:28.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你就不该有这种念头\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You shouldn't be doing this to yourself.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:28.57,1:45:30.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}根本就是白日做梦\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is just shitty pipe dreams.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:31.08,1:45:33.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}墨西哥在这儿 你在这儿\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mexico is way down there and you're in here...
Dialogue: 0,1:45:33.70,1:45:35.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天南地北的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...and that's the way it is.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:35.66,1:45:38.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没错 天南地北\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, right. That's the way it is.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:40.00,1:45:42.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天涯海角\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's down there and I'm in here.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:44.96,1:45:47.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}说到底 只是一个简单的选择\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I guess it comes down to a simple choice.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:50.59,1:45:52.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是忙着去活\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Get busy living...
Dialogue: 0,1:45:53.47,1:45:55.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还是忙着去死\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...or get busy dying.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:59.23,1:46:00.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Andy.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:04.02,1:46:05.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Red?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:07.61,1:46:10.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果你哪天能出去 帮我个忙\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If you ever get out of here, do me a favor.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:10.53,1:46:12.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没问题 你说\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sure, Andy. Anything.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:14.70,1:46:18.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在巴克斯顿有片干草地 知道巴克斯顿在哪吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There's a big hayfield up near Buxton. You know where Buxton is?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:20.04,1:46:23.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-那一带多的是干草地 -有一块和其他的不一样\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-A lot of hayfields up there.   -One in particular.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:23.34,1:46:27.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那块地旁边有长长的石头墙， 北端有棵大橡树\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's got a long rock wall with a big oak tree at the north end.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:27.46,1:46:30.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}像罗伯特 佛洛斯特的诗一样美\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's like something out of a Robert Frost poem.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:31.30,1:46:33.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我就是在那儿向妻子求婚的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's where I asked my wife to marry me.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:35.22,1:46:37.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们去那儿野餐\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We went there for a picnic...
Dialogue: 0,1:46:37.72,1:46:39.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在橡树下做爱\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...and made love under that oak...
Dialogue: 0,1:46:40.48,1:46:42.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我求婚 她同意\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...and I asked and she said yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:46.73,1:46:48.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}答应我 瑞德\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Promise me, Red.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:49.40,1:46:51.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果你还有出去的那天\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If you ever get out...
Dialogue: 0,1:46:51.20,1:46:52.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}去找到那个地方\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...find that spot.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:53.91,1:46:58.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}墙底下埋着一块石头， 缅因州本地不产那种石头\N{\rEN\blur0.8}At the base of that wall, there's a rock that has no earthly business in Maine.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:59.87,1:47:03.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是一块黑色的火山玻璃石\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Piece of black, volcanic glass.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:05.59,1:47:08.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}石头下面还埋着东西 给你的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Something's buried under it I want you to have.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:09.01,1:47:10.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么东西？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What, Andy?
Dialogue: 0,1:47:10.67,1:47:12.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}安迪 你在下面埋了什么东西？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What's buried under there?
Dialogue: 0,1:47:14.01,1:47:15.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你搬开上面盖着的石头\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You'll have to pry it up...
Dialogue: 0,1:47:16.06,1:47:17.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就知道了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...to see.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:23.35,1:47:25.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不 听我说 这家伙.\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, I'm telling you. The guy is....
Dialogue: 0,1:47:25.86,1:47:27.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}胡言乱语的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He's talking funny.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:28.69,1:47:30.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我真担心他\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm really worried about him.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:30.82,1:47:32.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们盯着他点吧\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let's keep an eye on him.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:32.40,1:47:35.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}白天还行，晚上他住单间怎么盯\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's fine during the day, but at night he's all alone.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:37.16,1:47:38.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}坏了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, Lord.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:39.62,1:47:41.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}怎么了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:47:41.96,1:47:44.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}安迪今天到载货区\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Andy come down to the loading dock today.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:44.88,1:47:47.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}问我要了·一截绳子\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He asked me for a length of rope.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:47.17,1:47:50.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-绳子？  -有6英尺长\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Rope?   -Six feet long.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:50.17,1:47:51.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}然后你还真给他了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And you gave it to him.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:52.38,1:47:54.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}给了啊，为什么不给？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sure I did. Why wouldn't I?
Dialogue: 0,1:47:54.34,1:47:56.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}老天！ 赫伍\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Jesus! Heywood.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:56.55,1:47:58.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我怎么知道？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How was I supposed to know?
Dialogue: 0,1:47:58.68,1:48:00.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还记得老布吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Remember Brooks Hatlen?
Dialogue: 0,1:48:00.60,1:48:04.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}安迪不会的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No. Andy would never do that.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:04.85,1:48:06.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}绝对不会\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Never.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:07.98,1:48:09.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}难说\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:12.15,1:48:14.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}人都有崩溃的时候\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Every man has his breaking point.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:16.53,1:48:18.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}动作快点 我要回家了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Lickety-split. Want to get home.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:19.08,1:48:20.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}马上好\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Just about finished, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:37.97,1:48:39.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}今晚要存三笔\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Three deposits tonight.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:47.60,1:48:49.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}把衣服送去洗了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Get my stuff down to the laundry.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:49.65,1:48:51.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}鞋子擦亮\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And shine my shoes.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:51.48,1:48:54.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-和镜子一样亮 -是\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-I want them looking like mirrors.   -Yes, Sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:59.95,1:49:01.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你回来真好\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's good having you back, Andy.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:02.37,1:49:04.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这地方没有你，总觉得有点不对劲\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Place wasn't the same without you.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:51.13,1:49:52.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}熄灯！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Lights out!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:25.04,1:50:27.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我也熬过漫漫长夜\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I've had some long nights in the stir.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:28.08,1:50:30.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}黑暗中独自一人 想来想去\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Alone in the dark with nothing but your thoughts...
Dialogue: 0,1:50:30.92,1:50:33.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}时间慢的如同刀割\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...time can draw out like a blade.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:38.97,1:50:42.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那是我毕生最长的一夜\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That was the longest night of my life.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:57.82,1:50:59.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}报告人数！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Give me a count!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:03.49,1:51:06.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}三层南 到齐！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Tier 3 south, clear!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:09.45,1:51:12.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}二层245房没人！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Man missing on tier 2, cell 245!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:12.79,1:51:13.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}杜弗伦！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Dufresne!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:14.42,1:51:16.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}出来 别装大牌！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come out. You're holding up the show!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:20.01,1:51:23.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别逼我去找你，到时候打得你满头开花！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't make me come down or I'll thump your skull for you!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:30.98,1:51:34.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}操 还不出来 你敢拖我后腿！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Damn it, you're putting me behind! I got a schedule to keep.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:34.98,1:51:38.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你要是没死没病，看我怎么收拾你！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You'd better be sick or dead in there. I shit you not!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:38.48,1:51:39.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听到了吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You hear me?
Dialogue: 0,1:51:45.95,1:51:48.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我的老天爷\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, my Holy God.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:05.05,1:52:07.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这个区每个人都给我问一遍\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I want every man on this cellblock questioned.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:08.06,1:52:10.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-先从他朋友下手 -谁？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Start with that friend of his.   -Who?
Dialogue: 0,1:52:10.77,1:52:12.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Him.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:13.18,1:52:14.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}打开237房\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Open 237.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:18.27,1:52:21.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么叫"他不见了"？？j 这算什么话\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What do you mean, "He just wasn't here"? Don't say that to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:22.82,1:52:25.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-你敢再这么说话试试 -但是他真的不见了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Don't say that to me again.   -But, sir, he wasn't.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:25.61,1:52:29.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我能看见 海格！ 你当我瞎啊？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I can see that, Haig! Think I'm blind?
Dialogue: 0,1:52:29.74,1:52:31.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你是这个意思吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Is that what you're saying?
Dialogue: 0,1:52:31.45,1:52:34.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-海格 我瞎吗？  -不瞎， 长官！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Am I blind, Haig?   -No, sir!
Dialogue: 0,1:52:34.92,1:52:37.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那你呢 你瞎吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What about you. You blind?
Dialogue: 0,1:52:37.92,1:52:40.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-这是什么，告诉我 -昨晚的点名册\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Tell me what this is.   -Last night's count.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:40.50,1:52:44.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看见杜弗伦的名字了吗？ 我能看见 就这儿\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Uh-huh. You see Dufresne's name there? I sure do. Right there.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:44.13,1:52:45.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}11 杜弗伦\N{\rEN\blur0.8}"Dufresne."
Dialogue: 0,1:52:47.18,1:52:50.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}昨晚熄灯前他在牢房里\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He was in his cell at lights out.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:50.06,1:52:53.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}早上他也应该在\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Stands to reason he'd still be here in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:53.35,1:52:55.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}把他找出来\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I want him found.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:55.14,1:52:58.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一刻也不能拖 就现在！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Not tomorrow, not after breakfast. Now!
Dialogue: 0,1:52:58.86,1:53:00.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}遵命\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:01.11,1:53:04.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}赶紧 动起来 快点！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let's go. Move your butts. Move it!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:06.78,1:53:07.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}站住\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Stand.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:09.20,1:53:10.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well?
Dialogue: 0,1:53:13.70,1:53:14.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, what?
Dialogue: 0,1:53:14.87,1:53:18.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们俩成天粘在一块儿\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I see you two all the time. You're thick as thieves, you are.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:19.46,1:53:21.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他肯定说过什么吧\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He must have said something.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:21.71,1:53:24.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}报告典狱长，他什么都没说过\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, sir, warden. Not a word.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:26.38,1:53:29.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}上帝啊 这是个奇迹！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Lord, it's a miracle!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:29.55,1:53:32.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好端端一个人，像个屁一样凭空就没了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Man vanished like a fart in the wind.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:32.81,1:53:34.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么都没留下\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Nothing left...
Dialogue: 0,1:53:34.81,1:53:37.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就剩下窗台上一堆石头\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...but Some damn rocks on a windowsill.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:37.69,1:53:40.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还有墙上这个骚货 要不我们问问她吧\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And that cupcake on the wall. Let's ask her.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:40.65,1:53:42.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}可能她知道呢\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Maybe she knows.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:42.23,1:53:45.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}说句话啊 短裤小妞 说话啊？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What say there, fuzzy-britches? Feel like talking?
Dialogue: 0,1:53:45.78,1:53:48.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦 她应该不会说话吧\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, guess not.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:48.74,1:53:50.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们都不说 她为什么要说呢？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Why should she be any different?
Dialogue: 0,1:53:51.99,1:53:53.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们有阴谋\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is a conspiracy.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:54.29,1:53:56.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就是这么回事儿\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's what this is.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:56.75,1:54:00.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}全他妈是阴谋！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}One big, damn conspiracy!
Dialogue: 0,1:54:00.75,1:54:02.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们人人都有份！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And everyone's in on it!
Dialogue: 0,1:54:03.38,1:54:04.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}包括她！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Including her!
Dialogue: 0,1:54:39.58,1:54:41.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}1966年\N{\rEN\blur0.8}In 1966...
Dialogue: 0,1:54:41.42,1:54:43.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}安迪杜弗伦逃离\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...Andy Dufresne escaped...
Dialogue: 0,1:54:44.04,1:54:45.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}肖申克监狱\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...from Shawshank Prison.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:47.88,1:54:50.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}狱方只找到了-一件沾满泥巴的囚衣\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All they found of him was a muddy set of prison clothes...
Dialogue: 0,1:54:51.09,1:54:52.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一块肥皂\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...a bar of soap...
Dialogue: 0,1:54:52.76,1:54:54.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还有一把石锤\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...and an old rock hammer...
Dialogue: 0,1:54:54.55,1:54:57.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}都快被磨秃了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...damn near worn down to the nub.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:01.56,1:55:06.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我还记得当初开玩笑说，一个人 要花600年才能挖通出去的隧道\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I remember thinking it would take a man 600 years to tunnel through the wall with it.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:06.98,1:55:09.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}老安迪只花了不到20年就办到了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Old Andy did it in less than 20.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:27.88,1:55:30.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}安迪特别喜欢研究地质学\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, Andy loved geology.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:30.97,1:55:34.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}地质学 他这种做事一丝不苟的人应该很喜欢\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I imagine it appealed to his meticulous nature.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:34.51,1:55:36.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这块石头来自冰河时代\N{\rEN\blur0.8}An ice age here...
Dialogue: 0,1:55:36.80,1:55:39.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那块石头来自几百万年的造山运动\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...Million years of mountain-building there.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:40.31,1:55:43.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}地质学是研究压力和时间的学问\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Geology is the study of pressure and time.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:43.98,1:55:46.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就这么简单\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's all it takes, really.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:46.69,1:55:48.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}压力\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Pressure...
Dialogue: 0,1:55:48.44,1:55:50.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}和时间\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...and time.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:51.03,1:55:53.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还要外加一张巨大无比的海报\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That and a big goddamn poster.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:56.91,1:55:58.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我说过\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Like I said...
Dialogue: 0,1:55:58.58,1:56:02.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在牢里 没事也得找事做\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...1N prison, a man will do anything to keep his mind occupied.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:05.38,1:56:10.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}原来安迪最爱的嗜好就是 把墙上凿下来的东西\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Seems Andy's favorite hobby was toting his wall out into the exercise yard...
Dialogue: 0,1:56:10.71,1:56:12.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}用手一把一把地带到操场上倒掉\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...a handful at a time.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:13.97,1:56:16.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}大概就在汤米死后\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I guess after Tommy was killed...
Dialogue: 0,1:56:16.18,1:56:19.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}安迪决定不再久留\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...Andy decided he'd been here just about long enough.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:19.35,1:56:22.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}动作快点 我要回家了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Lickety-split. Want to get home.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:22.73,1:56:24.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}马上好\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm just about finished, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:46.21,1:56:48.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}今晚要存三笔\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Three deposits tonight.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:55.42,1:56:57.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}安迪遵命行事\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Andy did like he was told.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:57.89,1:57:01.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}把鞋子擦的雪亮\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Buffed those shoes to a high mirror-shine.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:05.10,1:57:07.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}警卫根本没注意到\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The guards simply didn't notice.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:07.73,1:57:09.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我也没注意\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Neither did 1.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:09.36,1:57:10.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}说真的.\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean, seriously...
Dialogue: 0,1:57:11.07,1:57:14.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谁会没事盯着别人的鞋看？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}... how often do you really look at a man's shoes?
Dialogue: 0,1:59:17.69,1:59:20.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}安迪就这样爬向自由\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Andy crawled to freedom through 500 yards...
Dialogue: 0,1:59:21.03,1:59:24.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在难以想象的无比恶臭中匍匐500码\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...Of shit-smelling foulness I can't even imagine.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:25.41,1:59:27.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这种事我大概是干不出来的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Or maybe I just don't want to.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:32.16,1:59:34.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}500码\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Five hundred yards.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:35.04,1:59:38.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}足有5个橄榄球场加起来那么长\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's the length of five football fields.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:38.76,1:59:41.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}几乎长达半英里\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Just shy of half a mile.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:36.52,2:00:41.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}第二天早晨，在拉寇儿坦露她的秘密之时\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The next morning, right about the time Raquel was spilling her little secret...
Dialogue: 0,2:00:41.44,2:00:44.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一个之前从来没有现身过的人\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...a man nobody ever laid eyes on before...
Dialogue: 0,2:00:44.45,2:00:47.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}缓缓走进缅因州银行\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...Strolled into the Maine National Bank.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:47.66,2:00:50.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}直到这一刻，他才从纸面上的虚构.\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Until that moment, he didn't exist.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:51.41,2:00:53.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-变成现实中的真人 -有什么可以效劳的吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Except on paper.   -May I help you?
Dialogue: 0,2:00:54.16,2:00:56.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所有的正规证件他一个不少\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He had all the proper ID--
Dialogue: 0,2:00:56.29,2:01:00.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}驾驶执照 出生证明 社保卡号\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Driver's license, birth certificate, Social Security card.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:00.46,2:01:03.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就连签名都一丝不差\N{\rEN\blur0.8}--and the signature was a spot-on match.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:03.13,2:01:06.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}失去您这个客户我真心感到遗憾\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I must say I'm sorry to be losing your business.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:06.47,2:01:08.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}祝您在海外生活愉快\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I hope you'll enjoy living abroad.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:09.01,2:01:10.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢谢\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:10.76,2:01:12.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我一定会的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm sure I will.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:12.85,2:01:16.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是您的本票，还需要其他服务吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Here's your cashier's check, sir. Will there be anything else?
Dialogue: 0,2:01:16.35,2:01:17.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}麻烦您\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Please.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:17.98,2:01:20.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}帮我把它寄出去好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Would you add this to your outgoing mail?
Dialogue: 0,2:01:20.98,2:01:22.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}乐意效劳\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'd be happy to.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:23.98,2:01:25.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}祝您日安 先生\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Good day, sir.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:26.24,2:01:30.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那天早上 史蒂文斯先生造访了 波特兰一带的十几家银行\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mr. Stevens visited nearly a dozen banks in the Portland area.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:31.16,2:01:32.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}总共加起来.\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All told, he blew town...
Dialogue: 0,2:01:32.91,2:01:37.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他一共领走了典狱长诺顿37万多美元\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...with better than $370,000 of Warden Norton's money.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:38.50,2:01:41.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}服刑19年的遣散费\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Severance pay for 19 years.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:48.51,2:01:50.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}早安 这里是波特兰号角日报\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Good morning, Portland Daily Bugle.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:51.10,2:01:53.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}肖申克监狱，贪污 谋杀
Dialogue: 0,2:02:01.82,2:02:04.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}主的审判迅速降临.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:20.42,2:02:23.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}亲爱的典狱长 你说的对。 得救之道 就在其中
Dialogue: 0,2:02:43.56,2:02:46.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你就是拜伦 海利？ 你有权保持沉默\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Byron Hadley? You have the right to remain silent.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:46.78,2:02:51.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果你放弃这项权利，你的话 可能并且必然在法庭上对你构成危害\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If you give up this right, anything you say can be held against you in court.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:51.61,2:02:56.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}当时我没在场，没法亲眼见证 不过 我听说，被带走的时候\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I wasn't there to see it, but I hear Byron Hadley sobbed like a little girl...
Dialogue: 0,2:02:56.24,2:02:57.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}拜伦 海利哭得像个小妞一样\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...when they took him away.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:03.67,2:03:07.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}至于诺顿 他可不想束手就擒\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Norton had no intention of going that quietly.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:23.02,2:03:24.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}塞缪尔 诺顿\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Samuel Norton.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:24.52,2:03:26.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们有法院出示的拘捕令 开门\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We have a warrant for your arrest. Open up.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:30.28,2:03:33.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}开门\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Norton. Open the door.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:33.32,2:03:34.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不知道用哪把钥匙\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm not sure which key.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:37.49,2:03:39.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Norton!
Dialogue: 0,2:03:44.79,2:03:46.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别自讨苦吃 诺顿！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Make it easy on yourself, Norton!
Dialogue: 0,2:03:58.22,2:04:01.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我猜 他脑子里最后一件事\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I like to think the last thing that went through his head...
Dialogue: 0,2:04:01.85,2:04:03.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}除了那颗子弹\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...other than that bullet...
Dialogue: 0,2:04:03.64,2:04:08.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}大概就是在想 安迪 杜弗伦 究竟是怎么把他搞垮的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...was to wonder how the hell Andy Dufresne ever got the best of him.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:10.65,2:04:14.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}典狱长"憾别人世"之后不久\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Not long after the warden deprived us of his company...
Dialogue: 0,2:04:14.36,2:04:16.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我收到一张明信片\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...I got a postcard in the mail.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:17.91,2:04:20.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}上面没写字 但邮戳上写着：\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It was blank, but the postmark said...
Dialogue: 0,2:04:20.91,2:04:23.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}德州汉考克堡\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...Fort Hancock, Texas.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:23.62,2:04:25.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}汉考克堡\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Fort Hancock...
Dialogue: 0,2:04:25.25,2:04:27.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就在边境线上\N{\rEN\blur0.8}..fight on the border.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:27.38,2:04:29.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}安迪出境了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's where Andy crossed.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:29.96,2:04:34.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我想象着，安迪开着 自己的篷车 一路向南\N{\rEN\blur0.8}When I! picture him heading south in his own car with the top down...
Dialogue: 0,2:04:34.42,2:04:36.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一想到这个，我就高兴\N{\rEN\blur0.8}..It always makes me laugh.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:38.51,2:04:40.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}安迪 杜弗伦\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Andy Dufresne...
Dialogue: 0,2:04:40.43,2:04:42.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}匍匐爬过恶臭之河\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...who crawled through a river of shit...
Dialogue: 0,2:04:42.64,2:04:45.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在彼岸重获新生\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...and came out clean on the other side.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:45.90,2:04:47.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}安迪 杜弗伦\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Andy Dufresne...
Dialogue: 0,2:04:48.06,2:04:49.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}太平洋在望\N{\rEN\blur0.8}... headed for the Pacific.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:52.65,2:04:54.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}海利一把抓住他衣领\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hadley's got him by the throat, right?
Dialogue: 0,2:04:54.99,2:04:58.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}说：我看这小子是活得不耐烦了I\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He says, "I believe this boy's about to have himself an accident."
Dialogue: 0,2:04:58.99,2:05:01.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}老朋友们时常聊起他\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Those of us who knew him best talk about him often.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:02.58,2:05:04.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他做过的那些惊人的事儿\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I swear, the stuff he pulled....
Dialogue: 0,2:05:04.41,2:05:07.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我的朋友们需要喝点啤酒 I\N{\rEN\blur0.8}"My friends could use a couple of beers."
Dialogue: 0,2:05:07.75,2:05:09.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他还真的做到了！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And he got it!
Dialogue: 0,2:05:10.67,2:05:13.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}安迪走了 有时候.\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sometimes it makes me sad, though...
Dialogue: 0,2:05:13.34,2:05:14.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}会让我难过\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...Andy being gone.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:15.47,2:05:19.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不得不反复提醒自己 有些鸟儿是关不住的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I have to remind myself that some birds aren't meant to be caged.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:20.10,2:05:22.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为它们的羽毛实在太过光辉\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Their feathers are just too bright.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:23.85,2:05:25.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}当它们飞走的时候\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And when they fly away...
Dialogue: 0,2:05:26.02,2:05:30.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你内心认识到，把它们关起来是一种 罪恶 而释放它们会让你由衷喜悦\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...the part of you that knows it was a sin to lock them up does rejoice.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:31.48,2:05:32.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不过\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But still...
Dialogue: 0,2:05:33.23,2:05:37.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}它们走后 你生活的地方 显得愈发枯燥无趣了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...the place you live in is that much more drab and empty that they're gone.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:41.78,2:05:44.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}也许我只是单纯地在怀念朋友吧\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I guess I just miss my friend.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:08.60,2:06:09.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}请坐\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Please sit down.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:15.61,2:06:17.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}艾利斯 博伊德 瑞丁\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ellis Boyd Redding...
Dialogue: 0,2:06:17.70,2:06:21.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你的资料表明你被判 终身监禁，已经服刑40年\N{\rEN\blur0.8}... your files say you've served 40 years of a life sentence.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:21.78,2:06:23.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你改过自新了吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You feel you've been rehabilitated?
Dialogue: 0,2:06:25.79,2:06:27.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}改过自新？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rehabilitated?
Dialogue: 0,2:06:29.37,2:06:31.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我想想/心\/U\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, now, let me see.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:32.29,2:06:34.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我根本不懂这个词儿什么意思\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't have any idea what that means.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:36.71,2:06:39.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}意思是你是否准备重返社会.\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It means you're ready to rejoin society--
Dialogue: 0,2:06:39.55,2:06:41.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}年轻人 这个我懂\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I Know what you think it means, sonny.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:44.06,2:06:46.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}它对我只是个虚词儿\N{\rEN\blur0.8}To me it's just a made-up word.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:47.39,2:06:49.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}政客们发明出来的词儿\N{\rEN\blur0.8}A politician's word so that...
Dialogue: 0,2:06:50.19,2:06:53.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这样 你们这些穿西装打领带的伙计们.\N{\rEN\blur0.8}... young fellas like yourself can wear a suit and a tie...
Dialogue: 0,2:06:54.19,2:06:55.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}才能有活干\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...and have a job.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:57.74,2:06:59.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你到底想知道什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What do you really want to know?
Dialogue: 0,2:07:00.61,2:07:02.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是不是后悔自己当初的行为？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Am I sorry for what I did?
Dialogue: 0,2:07:03.03,2:07:04.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那 你后悔吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, are you?
Dialogue: 0,2:07:06.08,2:07:09.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没有一天不觉得后悔的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There's not a day goes by I don't feel regret.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:10.29,2:07:13.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不是因为坐牢而后悔，也不是 因为你觉得我应该后悔而后悔\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Not because I'm in here or because you think I should.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:17.21,2:07:19.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}回想起以前的我.\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I look back on the way I was then...
Dialogue: 0,2:07:21.93,2:07:23.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那个年纪轻轻\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...€ YOUNG...
Dialogue: 0,2:07:24.22,2:07:27.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}做事不动脑子的孩子 犯下了重罪\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...stupid kid who committed that terrible crime.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:30.73,2:07:32.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我想和他谈谈\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I want to talk to him.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:34.36,2:07:36.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}跟他讲点道理\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I want to try and talk some sense to him.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:37.57,2:07:39.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}让他明白这个世界是怎么回事\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Tell him the way things are.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:41.57,2:07:43.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但我办不到\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But I can't.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:45.24,2:07:47.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那个孩子早就不见了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That kid's long gone...
Dialogue: 0,2:07:48.41,2:07:51.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在只剩下这个老头子\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...and this old man is all that's left.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:52.58,2:07:54.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我得接受现实\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I got to live with that.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:55.42,2:07:57.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}改过自新？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rehabilitated?
Dialogue: 0,2:07:57.50,2:07:59.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}狗屁不通的词儿\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's just a bullshit word.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:00.26,2:08:05.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}该盖章就盖吧 别浪费我时间\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So you go on and stamp your forms, sonny, and stop wasting my time.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:06.26,2:08:08.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}实话告诉你\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Because to tell you the truth...
Dialogue: 0,2:08:08.89,2:08:10.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我他妈不在乎\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...I don't give a shit.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:24.11,2:08:25.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}核准
Dialogue: 0,2:09:20.34,2:09:22.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}老布到此一游
Dialogue: 0,2:09:37.40,2:09:38.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}女士 这边请\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Here you go, miss.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:41.73,2:09:42.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}上个厕所行吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Restroom break, boss?
Dialogue: 0,2:09:48.57,2:09:53.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不用每次撒尿都报告 想去就去\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You don't need to ask me every time you need to go take a piss. Just go. Understand?
Dialogue: 0,2:09:54.16,2:09:55.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:06.17,2:10:09.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我报告了40年了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Forty years I've been asking permission to piss.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:10.05,2:10:13.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没报告 一滴也挤不出来\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I can't squeeze a drop without say-so.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:16.56,2:10:18.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}残酷的现实是\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There's a harsh truth to face.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:20.40,2:10:23.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在外头，我根本混不下去\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No way I'm going to make it on the outside.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:31.20,2:10:34.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}难过之余，我总在想 怎么才能违犯假释规定\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All I do anymore is think of ways to break my parole...
Dialogue: 0,2:10:35.70,2:10:38.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这样他们就能收我回去了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...SO Maybe they'd send me back.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:43.38,2:10:45.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}整天担惊受怕的感觉糟糕透了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Terrible thing, to live in fear.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:46.71,2:10:48.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}老布懂得\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Brooks Hatlen knew it.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:48.55,2:10:50.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他太了解这种滋味了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Knew it all too well.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:52.09,2:10:55.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我只想生活在一个自己可以了解的环境中\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All I want is to be back where things make sense.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:55.93,2:10:58.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这样自己就不用总是担惊受怕\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Where I won't have to be afraid all the time.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:00.69,2:11:03.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}阻止我的 只有一件事：\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Only one thing stops me.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:04.48,2:11:06.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对安迪的承诺\N{\rEN\blur0.8}A promise I made to Andy.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:27.42,2:11:28.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}到了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There it is.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:39.14,2:11:40.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}非常感谢您\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Much obliged, sir.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:49.86,2:11:52.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}巴克斯顿
Dialogue: 0,2:15:20.15,2:15:21.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}亲爱的瑞德\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Dear Red:
Dialogue: 0,2:15:21.66,2:15:24.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}读到信 就表示你出狱了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If you're reading this, you've gotten out...
Dialogue: 0,2:15:24.28,2:15:28.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}都走了这么远了 再坚持一下吧\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...and if you've come this far, maybe you're willing to come a little further.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:28.62,2:15:31.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还记得那个小镇的名字吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You remember the name of the town, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,2:15:33.42,2:15:35.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}芝华塔尼欧\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Zihuatanejo.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:36.54,2:15:40.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}要实现我的计划 你绝对是个好帮手\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I could use a good man to help me get my project on wheels.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:40.67,2:15:44.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我会备好棋盘 随时恭候\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'll keep an eye out for you, and the chessboard ready.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:45.01,2:15:46.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}瑞德 记住\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Remember, Red...
Dialogue: 0,2:15:46.72,2:15:48.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}希望是好的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}... hope is a good thing...
Dialogue: 0,2:15:49.02,2:15:51.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}也许是万物中最好的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...maybe the best of things.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:51.18,2:15:53.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}美好的东西永不消逝\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And no good thing ever dies.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:53.94,2:15:56.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}希望你能读到这封信\N{\rEN\blur0.8}! will be hoping that this letter finds you...
Dialogue: 0,2:15:56.98,2:15:58.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}希望你读到信时一切都好\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...and finds you well.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:59.23,2:16:00.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你的朋友\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Your friend...
Dialogue: 0,2:16:00.65,2:16:01.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}安迪\N{\rEN\blur0.8}. Andy.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:35.69,2:16:37.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}忙着活\N{\rEN\blur0.8}"Get busy living...
Dialogue: 0,2:16:37.56,2:16:39.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}或者忙着死\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...or get busy dying."
Dialogue: 0,2:16:42.24,2:16:44.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真有道理\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's goddamn right.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:46.95,2:16:49.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}老布到此一游 瑞德也到此一游
Dialogue: 0,2:16:49.58,2:16:51.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我犯罪了了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}For the second time in my life...
Dialogue: 0,2:16:51.95,2:16:54.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是生平第二次\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...I'm guilty of committing a crime.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:55.62,2:16:57.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}出城 这违反假释规定\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Parole violation.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:58.25,2:17:01.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不知他们会不会搭起路障拦住我\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Of course, I doubt they'll toss up any roadblocks for that.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:02.59,2:17:04.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}像我这种老坏蛋，应该不会被逮到了吧\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Not for an old crook like me.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:04.76,2:17:06.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}德州汉考克堡\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Fort Hancock, Texas, please.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:10.51,2:17:15.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我激动的坐不住，脑子里 一个个念头不停地在想\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I find I'm so excited I can barely sit still or hold a thought in my head.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:15.69,2:17:19.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}大概只有自由人才会这么兴奋吧\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I think it's the excitement only a free man can feel.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:19.19,2:17:21.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一个即将踏上旅途的自由人\N{\rEN\blur0.8}A free man at the start of a long journey...
Dialogue: 0,2:17:21.90,2:17:24.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}前路漫长，结果未知\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...whose conclusion is uncertain.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:27.53,2:17:30.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}希望我可以成功越过边境\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I hope I can make it across the border.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:31.70,2:17:34.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}希望可以见到老友和他握握手\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I hope to see my friend and shake his hand.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:36.62,2:17:40.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}希望太平洋和我梦里一样蓝\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I hope the Pacific is as blue as it has been in my dreams.
